<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">Numbers</book>
  <para style="h">Numbers</para>
  <para style="toc1">Numbers</para>
  <para style="toc2">Numbers</para>
  <para style="mt">Numbers</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuah kum hnih kum, thla hnihna, ni khat nîah Sinai thlalêrah inbiakna puan inah Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte pung khâwm zawng zawngte chu, a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming indawt dân ang zêlin mipa zawng zawng chhiar vek rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kum sawmhnih achin chung lam Israel-te zînga mi râlkai chin zawng zawng chu, nang leh Aronan a pâwl pâwlin in chhiar vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, i hnênah hnam tin zînga mi pakhat, chi hrang hrang ata chhûngkaw puipa zêl an awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, hêng hi i hnêna awm tûr hmingte chu a ni: Reuben hnama mi Sedeura fapa Elizura;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Simeon hnama mi Zurisadaia fapa Selumiela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda hnama mi Aminadaba fapa Nasona;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isakar hnama mi Zuara fapa Nethanela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zebulun hnama mi Helona fapa Eliaba;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Josefa thlah, Ephraim hnama mi Amihuda fapa Elisama; Manase hnama mi Pedazura fapa Gamaliela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Benjamin hnama mi Gideonia fapa Abidana;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dan hnama mi Amisadaia fapa Ahiezera;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aser hnama mi Okrana fapa Pagiela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gad hnama mi Deuela fapa Eliasapha;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naphtali hnama mi Enana fapa Ahira.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hêngho hi mipuite zing ata thlan, an pi leh pute hnama puipa, Israel chhûngkaw puipate an ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia leh Arona chuan chûng an hming lamhote chu an hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />mipui zawng zawngte chu thla hnihna, ni khat nîah an ko khâwm vek a; a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming indawt dân ang zêlin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam zawng chu an thlahtute hming an târ lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk angin Sinai thlalêrah chuan a chhiar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israela fapa upa ber Reubena thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming indawt dân ang zêlin, mipa kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Reubena thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 46,500 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Simeona thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming indawt dân ang zêlin, mipa kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Simeona thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 59,300 an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gada thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming indawt dân ang zêlin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gada thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 45,650 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Juda thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming indawt dân ang zêlin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Juda thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 74,600 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isakara thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming indawt dân ang zêlin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isakara thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 54,400 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zebuluna thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming indawt dân ang zêlin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zebuluna thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 57,400 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Josefa thlah zînga mi Ephraima thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming tam dân ang zêlin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ephraima thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 40,500 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Manasea thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming tam dân ang zêlin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Manasea thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 32,200 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Benjamina thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming tam dân ang zêlin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Benjamina thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 35,400 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dana thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming tam dân ang zêlin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Dana thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 62,700 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Asera thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming tam dân ang zêlin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Asera thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 41,500 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Naphtalia thlah chhuante chu a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kuain, an hming tam dân ang zêlin, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Naphtalia thlah râlkai chin zawng zawngte chu 53,400 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chûngte chu an ni, Mosia leh Aronan Israel puipa sâwm leh pahnih, chhûngkaw puipate nêna an chhiarte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israela thlah a chhûngkua kuaa kum sawmhnih achin chung lam râlkai chin zawng zawng, Israel rama mi chu an chhiar a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />an chhiar zawng zawngte chu 6,03,550 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Levi mite thlahtute zawng an chhiar ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lalpan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Levi chi zawng i chhiar ve tûr a ni lo va, Israel mite zîngah i chhiar tel tûr a ni hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Levi-hote chu Pathian chênna in enkawltu leh, a bungrua zawng zawng leh, chumia thil awm zawng zawng enkawltuah i ruat zawk tûr a ni: biak bûk leh a bungrua zawng zawng an zâwn ṭhîn ang a; an enkawl ang a, biak bûk chu a vêlah an awmchilh ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk chu in sawn dâwn apiangin Levi-ho chuan an ṭhiat ang a; tin, biak bûk zâr dâwn apiangin Levi-hovin an zâr ṭhîn ang. Hnam dang rawn inrawlh apiang chu tihhlum tûr an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan mahni hmun ṭheuhvah, a pâwl pâwlin an tam dân azir zêlin an puan inte an zâr ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Levi-ho erawh chuan Israela thlahte pung khâwmho chunga thinurna a awm loh nân Pathian chênna in vêlah an zâr tûr a ni; Levi-ho chuan hriattîrna biak bûk chu an enkawl tûr a ni,” tiin a lo sawi tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Israela thlahte chuan an ti a; Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang zawng zawng chuan an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte chuan an chhûngkaw chhinchhiahnate târ ṭheuhvin an pâwl tih dân angin an puan in an zâr tûr a ni; inbiakna puan in ân ṭheuhvin a vêlin an zâr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni lo chhuahna khawchhak lampanga an chhûngkaw chhinchhiahna târin, puan in zâr tûrte chu Juda pâwlho an ni ang a; tin, Juda thlahte puipa tûr chu Aminadaba fapa Nasona a ni ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pâwlte tam lam chu 74,600 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a dawta puan in zârtu tûrte chu Isakar chi an ni tûr a ni a, Isakara thlahte puipa tûr chu Zuara fapa Nethanela a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A pâwlte tam lam chu 54,400 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Zebulun chite: Zebuluna thlahte puipa tûr chu Helona fapa Eliaba a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pâwlte tam lam chu 57,400 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An pâwl tam dân azir zêla Juda-ho an chhiarte chu 1,86,400 an ni. Anniho hian hma an hruai zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An chhûngkaw chhinchhiahna târin a chhim lampangah Reuben-ho chu an awm ang a; Reubena thlah puipa tûr chu Sedeura fapa Elizura a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pâwlte tam lam chu 46,500 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a dawta zâr tûr chu Simeon chi an ni ang: Simeona thlahte puipa tûr chu Zurisadaia fapa Selumiela a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pâwlte tam lam chu 59,300 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Gad chite: Gada thlahte puipa tûr chu Reuela fapa Eliasapha a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pâwlte tam lam chu 45,650 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Reuben-ho tam lam chu 1,51,450 an ni. Anni hi an dawta chhuak tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, inbiakna puan in chu a chhuak ang a, Levi-ho chu a laiah an awm ang a, an awmna azir zêlin a pâwl pâwlin an kal ṭheuh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An chhûngkaw chhinchhiahna târin a thlang lampangah chuan Ephraim-ho an awm ang a: Ephraima thlahte puipa tûr chu Amihuda fapa Elisama a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pâwlte tam lam chu 40,500 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a dawtah chuan Manase chi an ni ang: Manasea thlahte puipa tûr chu Pedazura fapa Gamaliela a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pâwl tam lam chu 32,200 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, a dawt lehah Benjamin chite: Benjamina thlahte puipa tûr chu Gideonia fapa Abidana a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pâwlte tam lam chu 35,400 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Ephraim-hote tam lam chu 1,08,100 an ni. Tin, a dawttu dawt lehtuah an chhuak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An chhûngkaw chhinchhiahna târin Dan-ho chu a hmâr lampangah an awm ang: Dana thlahte puipa tûr chu Amisadaia fapa Ahiezera a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A pâwlte tam lam chu 62,700 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, a dawta puan in zâr tûr chu Aser chi an ni ang: Asera thlahte puipa tûr chu Okrana fapa Pagiela a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A pâwlte tam lam chu 41,500 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, a dawt lehah Naphtali chite: Naphtalia thlahte puipa tûr chu Enana fapa Ahira a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A pâwlte tam lam chu 53,400 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Dan-ho tam lam chu 1,57,600 an ni. Tin, anniho hian a pâwl pâwla chhuakin hnu an dâl zêl tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hêng hi Israela thlahte chhûngkaw tina mi an chhiarte chu, an tam lam 6,03,550 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Levi-ho erawh chu Israela thlahte zînga chhiar an ni ve lo, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Israela thlahte chuan an ti a; Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang zêlin a pâwl pâwlin puan in an zâr a; tin, chutiang bawkin a chi chiin, a chhûngkua kua zêlin an chhuak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hênghote hi, Sinai tlânga Lalpan Mosia a biak laia Arona leh Mosia chhuana mite an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Arona fapate hming chu a upa ber Nadaba te, Abihua te, Eleazara te, Ithamara te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hêng hi puithiam atâna hriak thih, puithiam hna thawk tûra a tihhran Arona fapate hming chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Nadaba leh Abihua chu, Sinai thlalêra mei thiang lo Lalpa hmaa an hlan lai khân Lalpa hmaah an thi a; fa an nei lo. Eleazara leh Ithamara chuan an pa Arona dam laiin puithiam hna hi an thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Levi chite chu puithiam Arona hnênah hruai la, a rawng an bâwl theih nân a hnênah awmtîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan biak bûka rawngbâwl hna thawkin, inbiakna puan in bulah amah leh pung khâwm zawng zawng pualah rawng an bâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, bungrua zawng zawng an vawng ang a, Israela thlahte puala biak bûk rawngbâwl hna an thawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hote chu Arona leh a fapate hnênah i hlân ang a; Israela thlahte pualah a hnêna hlan an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Arona leh a fapate chu i ruat ang a, an puithiam nihna chu an chang reng ang; hnam dang rawn inrawlhte chu tihhlum an ni ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ngai teh, Levi-hote hi Israela thlahte zîng ata Israel thlahte fa tîr chhûl keu hmasa ber aiah keimah ngeiin ka lâk an ni a. Levi-ho chu ka ta an ni ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />fa tîr zawng zawng chu ka ta an ni si a. Aigupta rama fa tîr zawng zawng ka tihhlum ni khân Israel-te zînga fa tîr zawng zawng, a mihring a ranin ka pual atân ka hauh a ni. Ka ta an ni ang: kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Sinai thlalêrah Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Levia thlahte chu a chhûngkua kua leh a thlah thlahin chhiar la: mipa tawh phawt chu thla khat achin chung lam chu i chhiar tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chuan a tih tûra thupêk angin Lalpa thu ang chuan a chhiar hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Levia fapate hming chu Gersona te, Kohatha te, Meraria te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, an thlahtu Gersona fapate hming chu Libnia leh Simeia an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An thlahtu Kohatha fapate chu Amrama te, Izara te, Hebrona te, Uziela te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An thlahtu Meraria fapate chu Mahlia leh Musia an ni. Hêng hi an chhûngkua ang zêla Levi-ho thlahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gersona chu Libni-ho leh Simei-ho thlahtu a ni; hêng hi Gerson-ho thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mipa zawng zawng thla khat achin chung lam an chhiarte chu 7,500 zet an tling a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gerson-ho thlahte chuan an puan in chu biak bûk thlang lampangah an zâr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Gerson-ho chhûngkaw puipa chu Laela fapa Eliasapha a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gersona faten inbiakna puan ina an enkawl tûr chu biak bûk leh Puan In a ni ang, a chung te, inbiakna puan in kawngkhâr puanzâr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a kawtlai zâr te, biak bûk bula a kawtlai kawngkhâr puanzâr te, maichâm vêla mi te, chuta hman tûr hrui zawng zawngte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Kohatha chu Amram-ho te, Izhar-ho te, Hebron-ho te, Uziel-ho te thlahtu a ni; hêngho hi Kohatha thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mipa zawng zawng thla khat achin chung lam an chhiar dân ang chuan 8,300 an ni, hmun thianghlim enkawltu tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kohatha fapate thlahte chuan biak bûk chhim lampangah an puan in an zâr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kohath-ho thlahte chhûngkaw puipa tûr chu Uziela fapa Elizaphana a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An enkawl tûr chu bâwm te, dawhkân te, sathaukhâwnvâr dahna te, maichâm te, hmun thianghlima rawngbâwlna bungbêl zawng zawng te, puanzâr te, chuta rawngbâwlna thil zawng zawngte a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Arona fapa Eleazara chu Levi-ho puipate puipa a ni ang a, hmun thianghlim enkawltute chu a ho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Meraria chu Mali-ho leh Musi-ho thlahtu a ni. Hêng hi Meraria thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mipa zawng zawng thla khat achin chung lam an chhiar dân ang chuan 6,200 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Meraria thlah chhûngkaw puipa chu Abihaila fapa Zuriela a ni a. Biak bûk hmâr lampangah an puan in an zâr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Meraria fapate enkawl tûra ruat chu biak bûk ban rem khâwm te, a bangrel te, a ban te, a nghahchhan ker kuak te, a hmanrua zawng zawng te, rawngbâwlna hmanrua zawng zawngte an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />a kawt hung vêlna ban te, a nghahchhan ker kuak te, a kilhbehna leh a hruite nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Biak bûk chhak lampang inbiakna puan in bul, ni chhuahna lama puan in zârtu tûr chu Mosia leh Arona leh a fapate an ni ang a, hmun thianghlimah Israela thlahte pualah a ṭûl apiang an thawk ang; hnam dang rawn inrawlh apiang chu tihhlum tûr an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lalpa thupêka Levi-ho a thlah thlaha mipa zawng zawng thla khat achin chung lam Mosia leh Aronan an chhiar zawng zawng chu 22,000 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Israela thlahte zînga fa tîr, mipa, thla khat achin chung lam zawng zawng chhiar la, ka ta an ni, a zât hre rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hote chu (Lalpa chu ka ni a) Israela thlahte zînga fa tîr zawng zawng aiah ka hauh a ni; tin, Levi-ho rante chu Israela thlahte ran zawng zawnga piang hmasa ber aiah,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Lalpan thu a pêk angin Israela thlahte zinga fa tîr zawng zawng chu a chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />An hming indawt ang zêla thla khat achin chung lam fa tîr mipa zawng zawng an chhiarte chu 22,273 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Israela thlahte zînga fa tîr zawng zawng aiah Levi-ho chu ka ta an ni ang; kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hote aia an tamna Israela thlahte fa tîr 273 tlanna tûrin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />mi pakhat tân sekel 5 ṭheuh i la tûr a ni; hmun thianghlima sekel hman tûr a ni (sekel chu gera 20 a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A chuangho tlanna sum chu Arona leh a fapate i pe tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Levi-hovin an tlan bâka an tlanna sum chu a la a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Israela thlahte fa tîr lak aṭangin sum chu a la a; hmun thianghlim sekel angin 1,365 a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk, Lalpa thu angin Mosia chuan tlanna sum chu Arona leh a fapate a pe a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Levia fate zînga Kohatha thlahte, a thlah thlahin, a chhûngkua kuain,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kum sawmthum achin chung lam, kum sawmnga thlengin rawngbâwlna hna, inbiakna puan ina thawk tûr zawng zawng zât chu chhiar vek rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Inbiakna puan in hmun thianghlim bera Kohatha fapate hnathawh tûr chu hei hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />awm hmun an sawn dâwn apiangin Arona chu a fapate nên an lût ang a, hmun thianghlim puanzâr an hlîp thla ang a, chu chuan thuthlung bâwm an khuh ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chu chu savun ṭha miin an khuh ang a, chu chu puan dumpâwlin an khuh ang a, a zâwnfung an vuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, entîrna chhang dawhkân chungah puan dumpâwl an phah ang a, chutah chuan thlêngte, fiante, berhbute leh note a bun chhuahna tûr an dah tûr a ni; tin, chatlak lova chhang dah chu chutah chuan a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu chu puan senin an khuh ang a; a khuhna savun ṭha miin an khuh ang a, a zâwnfung an vuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a êntu khâwnvâr dahna leh chumi atâna an hman tûr a khâwnvârte, a chaichehte, a vâp dahnate, hriak bûr zawng zawngte puan dumpâwlin an khuh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi leh a hmanrua zawng zawng chu a khuhna savun ṭha mia khuhin a zâwnnaah an dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, rangkachak maichâm chu puan dumpâwlin an khuh ang a, a khuhna savun ṭha miin an khuh leh ang a, a zâwnfung an vuah tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />hmun thianghlima an hmanrua, rawngbâwlna bungbêl zawng zawng chu an la vek ang a, puan dumpâwlin an fûn ang a, a khuhna savun ṭha miin an khuh ang a, a zâwnnaah an dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, maichâma meivâp chu an lâwk fai ang a, a chungah puan dumpâwl an phah ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tin, a chungah chuan an rawngbâwl vêlna bungbêl zawng zawng mei lâkna te, sa thurna thîr kawm te, vut lawhna te, maihûn te, maichâm bungbêl zawng zawngte an dah ang a; tin, a khuhna savun ṭha miin an khuh ang a, a zâwnfung an vuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Arona leh a fapaten hmun thianghlim leh hmun thianghlim bungrua zawng zawng an khuh zawha, awm hmun sawn dâwn apiangin, Kohatha fapate chu a zâwn tûrin an lo thawk ṭhîn ang a; nimahsela, thil thianghlimte chu an khawih tûr a ni lo, an khawih zawngin an thi ang. Chûng chu inbiakna puan ina Kohatha fapate chanpual tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Arona fapa Eleazara thawh tûr chu, chhit tûr hriak te, rimtui te, chatlak lova chhangphut thilhlan te, hriak thih mi te, biak bûk, chuta thil awm zawng zawng te, hmun thianghlim leh a bungruate ngaihtuah vêl a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kohatha thlah chhûngkua chu Levi-ho zîng ata bo mai lova, thil thianghlimte khawih lova thi lova an awm theih nân hetiang hian ti rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Arona leh a fapate chu lût sela, an thawh tûr leh an chanpual tûr ṭheuh ruatsak rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />amaherawhchu, thil thianghlim en tûrin rei lo tê pawh lût suh se, an luh chuan an thi ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Gersona fapate pawh an chhûngkua kuain, a thlah thlahin chhiar vek rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />kum sawmthum achin chung lam kum sawmnga mi thlengin, rawngbâwlna hna inbiakna puan ina thawk tûr zawng zawng zât chu chhiar vek rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gersona thlahho chanpual chu rawngbâwl lam leh phurh lam a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />biak bûk puanzâr te, inbiakna puan in te, a khuhna te, a chung khuhna savun ṭha mi te, inbiakna puan in kawngkhâr puanzâr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />kawt hung puanzâr te, kawt hung kawngkhâr puanzâr te, biak bûk leh maichâm bula mi, a hrui te, an hmanrua zawng zawngte an phur ang a, tih ṭûl apiang an ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gersona thlahte chuan Arona leh a fate kawhhmuh ang zêlin hna an thawk ang a, an tih tûr tê tê chena ruatsak tûrin thu i neihtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng chu inbiakna puan ina Gersona thlahte thawh chu a ni. An tih tûr chu puithiam Arona fapa Ithamara ruat tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Meraria fapate chu a thlah thlahin, a chhûngkua kuain i chhiar tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />kum sawmthum achin chung lam kum sawmnga mi thlengin inbiakna puan ina thawk tûr zât i chhiar vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Inbiakna puan ina an hnathawh, an chanpual tûr chu hei hi a ni - biak bûk ban rem khâwm te, a bangrel te, a ban te, a nghahchhan ker kuak te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />a kawt hung vêlna ban te, a nghahchhan ker kuak te, a kilhbehna te, a hrui te, a hmanrua zawng zawng leh a hmanraw dang zawng zawng phurh te; a hming lam zêl ṭheuhvin an chanpual tûr i ruatsak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chûng chu an ni, puithiam Arona fapa Ithamara hova inbiakna puan ina Meraria fapate thlahtehovin, an tih tûr tê tê chena an rawngbâwl dân tûr chu,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia leh Arona leh pung khâwmho zînga puipate chuan Kohath-ho fapate chu a thlah thlahin, a chhûngkua kuain,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />inbiakna puan ina thawk tûr zât chu kum sawmthum achin chung lam kum sawmnga mi thlengin an chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chûngho a thlah thlaha an chhiar chu 2,750 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chûng chu an ni, inbiakna puan ina rawngbâwl ṭhîn Kohath-ho thlah an chhiar, Mosia hmanga Lalpa thupêk anga Mosia leh Aronan an chhiarte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Gersona fapate, inbiakna puan ina thawk tûra rawngbâwl zât tûr chu a thlah thlahin, a chhûngkua kuain kum sawmthum achin chung lam kum sawmnga mi thlenga chhiar an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />chûng a thlah thlaha, a chhûngkua kuaa an chhiarte chu 2,630 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chûng chu an ni, Gersona fapate thlahho inbiakna puan ina rawngbâwlho zawng zawng, Lalpa thupêk anga Mosia leh Aronan an chhiarte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Meraria fapate, inbiakna puan ina thawk tûra rawngbâwl zât tûr chu, a thlah thlahin, a chhûngkua kuain, kum sawmthum achin chung lam kum sawmnga mi thlenga chhiar an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />chûng a thlah thlaha, a chhûngkua kuaa an chhiarte chu 3,200 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chûng chu an ni, Meraria fapate thlahho an chhiar, Mosia hmanga Lalpa thupêk anga Mosia leh Aronan an chhiarte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Levi-ho, rawngbâwl tûr leh inbiakna puan ina phurh mi phurtu tûr zât a thlah thlahin, a chhûngkua kuain, kum sawmthum achin chung lam kum sawmnga mi thlengin, Mosia leh Arona leh Israel-ho puipate chuan an chhiar a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />chûng an chhiarte chu 8,580 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mosia hmanga Lalpa thupêk angin mi tin an thawh tûr leh an chanpual tura zir zêlin chhiar an ni a; chutiang tak chuan Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk anga chhiar an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte chu an riahhmun ata phâr zawng zawng leh, thi pût zawng zawng leh, mitthi avânga bawlhhlawh apiangte chu tichhuak vek tûrin thu pe rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hmei a pain i tichhuakin daipâwnah i dah tûr a ni; a lai taka ka awmna ṭhin an riahhmun chu an tibawlhhlawh dah ang e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte chuan chutiang chuan an ti a, dai pâwnah an dah chhuak a; Lalpan Mosia hnêna a sawi angin Israela thlahte chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Israela thlahte hnênah sawi la, ‘Mipa emaw, hmeichhia emawin Lalpa chungah thil eng pawh lo tisualin thiam loh chang sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />an tihsualnaah chuan thupha an chawi tûr a ni. A tihsual man chu kim takin rulh tûr a ni a; tin, a hmun ngaa ṭhena hmun khat a tihsualna pa chu a pek belh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, sual man têltuin laichîn a neih loh chuan, sual man Lalpa hnêna hlana chu puithiam pual tûr a ni ang a; inremna berâmpa tiam lovin inremna a siam tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte thil thianghlim thên thilhlan zawng zawng, hlansak tûra an pêk puithiam hnêna an hlan apiang a hlântu puithiamin a nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An thil serh chu anmahnin an nei ang, puithiam hnêna an pêk chu puithiamin a nei tûr a ni,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israela thlahte hnênah sawi la, an hnênah, ‘Tu nupui pawh uirêin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />miin mutpui sela, a pasal chuan hre lovin, chesual ngei si inpuang bawk si lo, kut man ni bawk si lo sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a pasal chuan thîkthu avângin ringhlel tlat ta sela emaw, nupui chesual lo pawh a rinhlelh tlat si chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />chutiang thûah chuan, chu mi chuan a tâna thilhlan barli chhangphut epha hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat kengin, a nupui chu puithiam hnênah a hruai tûr a ni; hriak a leih tûr a ni lo va, thil rimtui a telh tûr a ni hek lo; thîk thawina chhangphut thilhlan, hriat rengna thilhlan khawlohna hriat chhuahna a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan a rawn hruai ang a, Lalpa hmaah a dintîr ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tin, puithiam chuan hlumbêlin tui thianghlim a la ang a, biak bûk chhuata vaivut a la ang a, tuiah chuan a phul ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan hmeichhia chu Lalpa hmaah a dintîr ang a, a sam a thlahtîr ang a, hriat rengna chhangphut thilhlan, thîk thawina thilhlan chu a kentîr ang a; puithiam chuan ânchhe thlentîrtu tui khâ chu a keng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan hmeichhia chu chhia a chhamtîr ang a, hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “I pasal ni lo mi dang tu mahin an mutpui loh chia, bawlhhlawhna lama i kal pên loh chuan ânchhe thlentîrtu he tui khâ ata hi i lo fihlîm ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />amaherawhchu, khaw dang hawia i bawlhhlawha, i pasal ni lo mi tuin emaw a mutpui che chuan i fihlîm lo vang,” a ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan hmeichhia chu a vau vang a, chhia a chhamtîr ang a, hmeichhe hnênah puithiam chuan, “ Lalpan i malpui a tihbala, i pum a tihvûn chuan, Lalpan i chipuite ânchhe dawntîrtuah siam che rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tin, ânchhe thlentîrtu he tui hi i rîlah a lût ang a, i pum a tivûng ang a, i malpui a tirâwp ang,” a ti ang a; tin, hmeichhia chuan, “Amen, Amen,” a ti ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan chûng ânchhe thûte chu lehkhabuah a ziak ang a, tui khâah chuan a chiah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chu ânchhe thlentîrtu tui khâ chu a intîr tûr a ni a; tichuan, ânchhe thlentîrtu tui chu a kawchhûngah a lût ang a, a lo khâ ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan thîk thilhlan chhangphut, hmeichhe kut ata chu a la ang a, Lalpa hmaah chhangphut thilhlan chu a thên ang a, maichâmah a kalpui ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />puithiam chuan chhangphut thilhlan hriat chhuahtîrtu chu vei khatin a la ang a, maichâmah chuan a hâl ang a, chumi zawhah chuan tui chu hmeichhia a intîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, tui a han intîr chuan heti hi a ni ang a; a lo bawlhhlawha, a pasal chunga thil a tisual a lo nih chuan ânchhe thlentîrtu tui chu a kawchhûngah a lût ang a, a lo khâ ang a, a pum a lo vûng ang a, a malpui a lo râwp ang a; tichuan, hmeichhia chu a chipuite ânchhe dawntîrtu a lo ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hmeichhia chu a bawlhhlawh lohva, a thianghlim chuan a fihlîm ang a, nau pai thei zêl a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hei hi, nupui, khaw dang hawia a pasal ni lo mi dang nêna intibawlhhlawh emaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />mipain thîkna rilru a lo puta, a nupui a thîk emawa rêl dân chu a ni a; tichuan, Lalpa hmaah a hruai ang a, puithiam chuan hêng dân zawng zawng ang hian a chungah a ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipa chu khawlohnaah chuan a fihlîm ang a, hmeichhia chuan a sualna mawh a phur ang,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte hnênah sawi la, an hnênah, ‘Mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw pawhin eng emaw thutiam bik, Lalpa tâna inpêkna Nazarit thutiam a tiam lai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />uain leh zu a nghei tûr a ni; uain thûr pawh, zu thûr pawh a in tûr a ni lo va, grêp tui pawh a inin grêp rah a tharlâm pawh, pho vuai pawh a ei tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A intihhran chhûng zawng chuan grêp hruia mi a mu pawh, a pil pawh a ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Intihhranna thu a tiam chhûng zawng chuan a lû pawh meh hauh loh tûr a ni; Lalpa tâna a intihhran chhûng ni a kim hma loh chuan tihhran a ni ang a, a sam a zuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa tâna a intihhran chhûng zawng chuan mitthi ruang a hnaih tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A pa te, a nu te, a unaupa te, a farnu te emaw thih thûah pawh a intibawlhhlawh tûr a ni lo, Pathian tâna a intihhranna chuan a phuar avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A intihhran chhûng zawng chuan Lalpa pual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kiangah mi lo thi ta thutin a intihhranna lû chu lo tibawlhhlawh ta ang sela, a inthen ni, a ni sarih nîah a lû a mêt tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ni riat nîah inbiakna puan in kawngkaa puithiam hnênah ṭhuro tuak khat emaw, pârvano tuak khat emaw a rawn keng tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tin, puithiam chuan pakhat chu sual thawi nân a hlân ang a, pakhat chu hâlral thilhlanah, mitthi avânga a tisualnaah inremna a siamsak ang a; tin, chumi ni vêk chuan a lû chu a tithianghlim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, thiam loh thawi nân berâmno a pa kum khat mi rawn kengin, a intihhranna nite chu Lalpa hnênah a tiṭha leh ang; a intihhranna chu tihbawlhhlawh a nih tâk avângin a hmaa mi kha eng mah lo a ni ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, hei hi Nazarit mi, an intihhran ni bi a kim huna tih dân tûr chu a ni: inbiakna puan in kawngkaah hruai tûr a ni ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tin, Lalpa tâna thilhlanah berâmpa kum khat mi sawisêl bo hâlral thilhlanah pakhat, sual thawi nân berâmno a nu kum khat mi sawisêl bo pakhat, remna thilhlan atân berâmpa sawisêl bo pakhat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />dawidim telh loh chhang leh chhangphut dip tak, hriaka hmeh siam chhang hlâwm leh, hriaka chulh chhangpêr pan bâwm khat, an chhangphut thilhlan tûr leh in tûr thilhlan tûrte nên an hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, puithiamin chûng chu Lalpa hmaah a hlân ang a, a sual thawina leh a hâlral thilhlan chu a hlân ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tin, berâmpa chu bâwma chhang dawidim telh lohte nên chuan, remna inthawi thilhlan atânte Lalpa hnênah a hlân ang a; puithiam chuan chhangphut thilhlan leh in tûr thilhlan pawh chu a hlân tel bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nazarit mi chuan inbiakna puan in kawngkaah a intihhranna lû chu a mêt ang a, intihhranna sam chu a la ang a, remna inthawi thilhlan hnuaia meiah chuan a rawh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan berâmpa dâr chhum hmin leh, bâwma dawidim telh loh chhang pakhat leh, dawidim telh loh chhangpêr pan pakhat a la ang a, Nazarit chuan a intihhranna lû a meh zawhin a kentîr ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tin, puithiam chuan thên thilhlanah Lalpa hmaah a thên tûr a ni; hei hi puithiam pual a ni ang, thên irâwm leh thên bawp nên. Chumi zawhah chuan Nazarit chuan uain a in thei tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hei hi a ni, Nazarit thutiam dân leh Lalpa hmaa an thilhlan dân chu, ama duh thûa a hlan tiam lovin; a intihhranna thutiam azir zêlin a ti tûr a ni,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Arona leh a fapate hnênah, ‘Hetiang hian Israela thlahte mal in sâwm tûr a ni; an hnênah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“ Lalpan malsâwm che uin vêng zêl che u rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpan a hmêl in chungah êntîr sela, khawngaih zêl che u rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpan in lam lo hawi sela, thlamuanna pe che u rawh se,” tiin sawi rawh u,’ tiin sawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutianga ti chuan Israela thlahahte ka hming chuantîr a ni ang a; tin, keiin anni chu mal ka sâwm ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosian biak bûk chu a din zawha, hriak a thiha, a tihthianghlima, a bungrua zawng zawng leh a maichâm leh a bungbêl zawng zawng hriak a thiha, a tihthianghlim ni chuan heti hi a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel-ho puipa, an chhûngkaw puipate chuan thilhlan an hlân a, chûngho chu an hnam puipate, an chhiarhote chunga awm an ni a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />an thilhlante chu, tawlailîr chung nei paruk leh bâwngpa sâwm leh pahnih, puipa pahnihin tawlailîr pakhat zêl, pakhatin bâwngpa pakhat zêl Lalpa hmaah an rawn la a, biak bûk bulah chuan an rawn hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Biak bûk hna atân a ṭangkai dâwn a, lo la hlawm rawh khai; Levi-ho, an hna zir ang zêlin i pe ṭheuh dâwn nia,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian tawlailîrte leh bâwngpate chu a la a, Levi-hote chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tawlailîr pahnih leh bâwngpa pali chu Gersona fapate chu an hna azir zêlin a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, tawlailîr pali leh bâwngpa pariat chu puithiam Arona fapa Ithamara ho, Meraria fapate chu an hna azir zêlin a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kohatha fapate erawh chu a pe ve lo; hmun thianghlim hna chu an pual a ni a, a zâwna zâwn ṭhîn an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puipahote chuan hriak thih ni chuan maichâm hlan nâna an thilhlante chu maichâm bulah an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Puipa tinin maichâm hlan nâna an thilpêk chu a indawt zêlin ni tin an hlân tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni khat nia a thilhlan hlântu tûr chu Juda chi Aminadaba fapa Nasona a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thilhlan chu tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat, chhangphut thilhlan atân hriaka chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga. Hêng hi Aminadaba fapa Nasona thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni hnih ni chuan Isakar-ho puipa Zuara fapa Nethanela chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thilhlan atân chuan tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat, chhangphut thilhlan atân hriaka chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga a hlân a. Hêng hi Zuara fapa Nethanela thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ni thum ni chuan Zebuluna thlahte puipa Helona fapa Eliaba chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thilhlan chu tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat, chhangphut thilhlan atân hriaka chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga a ni. Hêng hi Helona fapa Eliaba thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ni li ni chuan Reubena thlahte puipa Sedeura fapa Elizura chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A thilhlan chu tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat, chhangphut thilhlan atâna hriak chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga a ni. Hêng hi Sedeura fapa Elizura thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ni nga ni chuan Simeona thlah Zurisadaia fapa Selumiela chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A thilhlan chu tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat, chhangphut thilhlan atân hriaka chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga a ni. Hêng hi Zurisadaia fapa Selumiela thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ni ruk ni chuan Gada thlahte puipa Deuela fapa Eliasapha chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A thilhlan chu tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat, chhangphut thilhlan atân hriaka chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga a ni. Hêng hi Deuela fapa Eliasapha thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ni sarih ni chuan Ephraima thlahte puipa Amihuda fapa Elisama chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A thilhlan chu tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat, hâlral thilhlan atân hriaka chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga a ni. Hêng hi Amihuda fapa Elisama thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ni riat ni chuan Manasea thlahte puipa Pedazura fapa Gamaliela chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />A thilhlan chu tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat; chhangphut thilhlan atâna hriak chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga a ni. Hêng hi Pedazura fapa Gamaliela thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ni kua ni chuan Benjamina thlah Gideonia fapa Abidana chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />A thilhlan chu tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat, chhangphut thilhlan atân hriaka chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga a ni. Hêng hi Gideonia fapa Abidana thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Ni sâwm ni chuan Dana thlahte puipa Amisadaia fapa Ahiezera chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />A thilhlan chu tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat, chhangphut thilhlan atân hriaka chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga a ni. Hêng hi Amisadaia fapa Ahiezera thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Ni sâwm leh ni khat ni chuan Asera thlahte puipa Okrana fapa Pagiela chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />A thilhlan chu tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat, chhangphut thilhlan atân hriaka chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga a ni. Hêng hi Okrana fapa Pagiela thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Ni sâwm leh ni hnih ni chuan Naphthalia thlahte puipa Enana fapa Ahira chuan a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />A thilhlan chu tangkaraw thlêng pakhat, a rih lam sekel za leh sawmthum, hmun thianghlima sekel sawmsarih tluka rit tangkaraw berhbu pakhat, chhangphut thilhlan atan hriak chawhpawlh chhangphut dip taka khat ve ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />sekel sâwm tluka rit rimtuia khat rangkachak fian pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />hâlral thilhlan atân bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="82" style="v" />sual thawi nân kelpa pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="83" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atân bâwngpa pahnih, berâmpa panga, kêlpa panga, berâmno a pa kum khat mi panga a ni. Hêng hi Enana fapa Ahira thilhlante chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />Tichuan, maichâm hriak thih nia Israel puipaho thilhlante chu tangkaraw thlêng sâwm leh pahnih, tangkaraw berhbu sâwm leh pahnih, rangkachak fian sâwm leh pahnih a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="85" style="v" />tangkaraw thlêng chu sekel za leh sawmthum tluka rit ṭheuh a ni a, berhbu chu sawmsarih ṭheuh a ni. Tangkaraw bungbêl zawng zawng chu hmun thianghlima sekel sânghnih leh zali tluka rit a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" />Rimtuia khat rangkachak fian sâwm leh pahnih chu hmun thianghlima sekel sâwm tluka rit ṭheuh a ni; rangkachak fian zawng zawng chu sekel za leh sawmhnih tluka rit a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="87" style="v" />Hâlral thilhlan atâna bâwngpa zawng zawng chu sâwm leh pahnih a ni a, berâmpa sâwm leh pahnih, berâmno a pa kum khat mi sâwm leh pahnih, an chhangphut thilhlante nên; tin, sual thawi nân kêlpa sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="88" style="v" />tin, remna inthawi thilhlan atâna bâwng chu bâwngpa sawmhnih leh pali a ni a, berâmpa chu sawmruk, kêlpa chu sawmruk, berâmno a pa kum khat mi chu sawmruk a ni. Hei hi hriak thih hnua maichâm hlan nâna thilpêkte chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Chutichuan, inbiakna puan ina amah be tûra Mosia a luh chuan, thuthlung bâwm chunga zahngaihna ṭhutphah chung lama cherub pahnihte inkâr aṭang chuan, amah rawn biain aw chu a hria a; tin, a be ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Arona bia la, a hnênah, ‘Khâwnvârte i hâlin khâwnvâr pasarih chuan sathau khâwnvâr dahna hma lam a ên tûr a ni,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Arona chuan chutiang chuan a ti a; Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang chuan khâwnvâr dahna hma lamah chuan khâwnvâr chu a chhi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hemi khâwnvâr dahna siam dân hmang chu rangkachak a chhera chher a ni; a bul ngul leh a pâr chenin chher a ni: Lalpan a lem Mosia a entîr ang chiahin khâwnvâr dahna chu a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Levi-hote chu Israela thlahte zîng ata tihrang la, tithianghlim rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anmahni tithianghlim tûrin hetiang hian i ti tûr a ni: an chungah tlen faina tui thlawr la, an taksa zawng zawng mehtîr la, an puante sûktîr la, intihthianghlimtîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, bâwngpatuai pakhat leh chhangphut thilhlan, hriaka pawlh chhangphut dip tak nên lâktîr la; tin, sual thawi nân bâwngpatuai pakhat dang i kai bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hote chu inbiakna puan in bulah chuan hruai la, Israela thlahte mipui zawng zawng chu pun khâwmtîr vek rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tin, Levi-hote chu Lalpa hnênah i hlân ang a; Israela thlahte chuan Levi-hote chungah an kut an nghat ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tichuan, Arona chuan Levi-hote chu, Lalpa rawng an bâwl theih nân Israela thlahte hmingin thên thilhlanah Lalpa hnênah a hlân ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hote chuan bâwngpa lûahte chuan an kut an nghat ang a; tin, Levi-hote tâna inremna siam nân, pakhat chu sual thawi nân, pakhat chu hâlral thilhlanah Lalpa hnênah i hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tin, Levi-hote chu Arona leh a fapate hmaah chuan i awmtîr ang a, Lalpa tâna thên thilhlanah i hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Israela thlahte zîng ata Levi-hote chu i tihrang ang a; tichuan, Levi-hote chu ka ta an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chumi zawhah chuan Levi-hote chu inbiakna puan ina rawngbâwl tûrin an lût ang a; tin, nangin anni chu i tithianghlim ang a, thên thilhlanah i hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israela thlahte zîng ata ka puala ruat an ni si a; chhûl keu zawng zawng Israela thlahte fa tîr zawng zawng aiah ka pualah ka nei tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israela thlahte zînga fa tîr zawng zawng chu ka ta an ni rêng a; mihring nên, rante nên; Aigupta rama fa tîr zawng zawng ka tihhlum lai khân ka puala ka ruat tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte zînga fa tîr zawng zawng aiah Levi-hote hi ka nei tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte aia inbiakna puan ina rawngbâwl tûr leh, Israela thlahten hmun thianghlim an rawn hnaih pawha Israela thlahte zînga hri a lên lohna tûra remna siam tûrin, Israela thlahte zîng ata Levi-hote hi Arona leh a fapate ka pe a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Mosia te, Arona te, Israela thlahte pung khâwmho zawng zawng chuan Levi-hote chungah chuan an ti a. Levi-ho chungchâng thûa Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang zawng zawng chuan an chungah Israela thlahte chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Levi-hote chu sual lakah an inthian fai a, an puante an su a; tin, Aronan Lalpa hmaah thên thilhlanah a hlân a; tin, anmahni tihthianghlim nân Aronan inremna a siamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, chumi zawhah Levi-hote chu Arona leh a fapate hnuaia an rawngbâwl hna thawk tûr chuan inbiakna puan in chhûngah an lût a; Levi-hote chungchâng thûa Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk angin an chungah an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Levi-hote chanpual chu hêng hi a ni: kum sawmhnih leh kum nga chin chung lam chuan inbiakna puan ina rawngbâwl hna an bei ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />kum sawmnga mite chuan rawngbâwl hna chu an chawlhsan ang a, rawng an bâwl tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, inbiakna puan in enkawl thûah chuan an unaute an puibâwm zêl ang a, rawng erawh chu an bâwl tawh lo vang. Hetiang hian Levi-hote chu an hnathawh i rêlsak tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuah achin kum hnihna, thla khatnaah Sinai thlalêran Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte chuan Kalhlên Kût chu a hunbi zêlah nei rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hunbiah, hemi thla ni sâwm leh ni li tlai lamah in nei tûr a ni. Chumia tih tûra ruat ang zawng zawng leh a dân ang zawng zawng chuan in nei tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian Israela thlahte chu Kalhlên Kût nei tûr chuan a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Sinai thlalêrah chuan thla khatna, ni sâwm leh ni li ni tlai lamah Kalhlên Kût chu an hmang ta a; Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang zawng zawng chuan Israela thlahte chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, tute emaw mitthi ruang avânga thianghlim lo an awm a, chumi ni chuan Kalhlên Kûtah an tel ve thei lo va; tichuan, chumi ni chuan Mosia leh Arona hmaah chuan an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chungho chuan a hnênah, “Mitthi ruang avângin kan thianghlim lo a ni a; eng vângin nge Israela thlahte zînga a hunbia Lalpa hnêna thilhlan kan hlan ve min khap?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Mosian an hnênah, “Lo ngawi rih teh u, in chungchâng thûah Lalpan engtin nge thu a pêk dâwn ka han hre rih phawt ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Israela thlahte hnênah, ‘In zînga mi pawh, in thlahte zînga mi pawh, mitthi ruang avânga thianghlim lo emaw, lo thang bo emaw an awm hlauh chuan Lalpa tâna Kalhlên Kût chu an nei ve rêng rêng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thla hnihna, ni sâwm leh ni li ni tlai lamah an nei tûr a ni. Chhang, dawidim telh loh hnim hnah khâ nên an ei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tûk atân chuan a enga mah an dah tûr a ni lo va, a ruh an titliak tûr a ni hek lo. Kalhlên kûta tih tûr ruat ang zawng zawng chu an ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, thianghlim si, thang bona nei si lova Kalhlên Kûta tel lo ringawt chu, a chipuite zîng ata chu mi chu tuithlâr a ni ang; a hunbia Lalpa hnêna thilhlan chu a hlan loh avângin chu mi chuan a sual mawh a phur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, hnam dang mi in hnêna awmin Lalpa tâna Kalhlên Kûta tel ve an duh chuan, Kalhlên Kûta tih tûr ruat leh a dân angin an ti tûr a ni; he rama mi rêng rêng leh hnam dang mite tân dân ang khat in nei tûr a ni,’ tiin sawi rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, biak bûk din ni chuan Pathian chênna in chu chhûmin a tuam mup a; tin, tlai lamah chuan biak bûk chungah chuan mei alh ang mai hi a tûk zîng thlengin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutiang chuan a awm reng a: chhûm chuan a tuam reng a, zânah chuan mei angin a lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhûmin puan in chu a kiansan apiangin Israela thlahte chuan kal zai an rêl ṭhîn a; tin, chhûm a dinna hmun apiangah chuan Israela thlahte chuan awm hmun an khuar ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa thupêkin Israela thlahte chu an kal zêl a, Lalpa thupêk bawkin awm hmun an khuar ṭhîn a; biak bûk chunga chhûm chu a awm chhûng zawng awm hmun an khuar reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk chunga chhûm chu rei tak a awm chuan, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa thu chu an zâwm a, an kal lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a châng chuan chhûm chu biak bûk chungah chuan ni rei lo tê chauh a awm ṭhîn a; tichuan, Lalpa thupêk angin awm hmun an khuar a, Lalpa thupêk angin an kal ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a châng chuan chhûm chu tlai lam aṭanga zîng thlengin a awm a: zînga chhûm chu a invawrh sân chuan an kal ṭhîn a; chhûnah emaw, zânah emaw, chhûm chu a invawrh sân apiangin an kal mai ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Biak bûk chungah chhûm chu ni hnih emaw, thla khat emaw, kum khat emaw pawh a awma, chuta a awm reng chuan Israela thlahte chuan awm hmun an khuar reng a, an kal ṭhîn lo va; a invawrh sân erawh chuan an kal ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa thupêkin awm hmun an khuar ṭhîn a, Lalpa thupêkin an kal ṭhîn; Mosia hmanga Lalpa thupêkin Lalpa thu chu an zâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tangkaraw tawtawrâwt pahnih siam la; a chhera chherin siam rawh: mipuiho koh khâwm nân leh chhuahtîr nân i hmang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu chu an ham kawp chuan mipui zawng zawng chu i hnênah inbiakna puan in kawngka bulah an rawn inkhâwm vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, pakhat chauh an ham chuan, Israel mipuite hotu puipate chauh i hnênah an lo kal khâwm tûr a ni ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, râlkhêl hama in ham chuan chhak lampanga awmhote an chhuak tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, râlkhêl hama in ham leh chuan chhim lampanga awmhote an chhuak tûr a ni; an chhuahna tûrin râlkhêl hamin an hâm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mipuite lo kal khâwmna tûr chuan in hâm phawt ang a, râlkhêl ham erawh chuan hâm lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Arona fapa puithiamhote chuan tawtawrâwt chu an hâm tûr a ni; chu chu in tân in thlahte thlenga kumkhaw dân tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In rama hmêlma hnuaichhiahtu che u do tûra in kal hunin, râlkhêl hamin tawtawrâwtte chu in hâm tûr a ni; tichuan, Lalpa in Pathian hmaah chuan hriat reng in ni ang a, in hmêlmate lakah chuan chhan him in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In hlimna nîah te, in kût hunbi neiah te, in thla tharah te chuan in hâlral thilhlanah leh in remna thilhlan inthawinaahte chuan tawtawrâwt in hâm tûr a ni; tichuan, in Pathian hmaa in tâna hriat rengna a ni dâwn nia: kei hi Lalpa in Pathian ka nih hi,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kum hnihna, chumi thla ni sawmhnih ni chuan heti hi a ni a, chhûm chu Pathian chênna in chung ata chu a lo invawrh sâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte chu an kal dân bi ang chuan Sinai thlalêr ata chu an chhuak a; tin, Paran thlalêrah chuan chhûm chu a ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosia hmanga Lalpa thupêk angin an chhuak ta phawt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hmasa berin Juda pâwlho an chhungkaw chhinchhiahna kengin an chhuak a; a hotu chu Aminadaba fapa Nasona a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isakar-ho hotu chu Zuara fapa Nethanela a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zebulun-ho hotu chu Helona fapa Eliaba a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, biak bûk chu an ṭhiat a, Gersona fapate leh Meraria fapa, biak bûk zâwntute chu an chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Reuben-ho chu an chhûngkaw chhinchhiahna kengin an chhuak a; a hotu chu Sedeura fapa Elizura a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Simeon-ho hotu chu Zurisadaia fapa Selumiela a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gad-ho hotu chu Deuela fapa Eliasapha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Kohath-hote chuan thil thianghlim chu an zâwn a, an chhuak a; tin, a dangte chuan an thlen veleh biak bûk chu an lo din diam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ephraim-ho chu an chhungkaw chhinchhiahna kengin an chhuak a; a hotu chu Amihuda fapa Elisama a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Manase-ho hotu chu Pedazura fapa Gamaliela a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Benjamin-ho hotu chu Gideonia fapa Abidana a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a hnuhnûng berah Dan-ho chu an chhûngkaw chhinchhiahna kengin an chhuak a; a hotu chu Amisadaia fapa Ahiezera a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aser-ho hotu chu Okrana fapa Pagiela a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Naphtali-ho hotu chu Enana fapa Ahira a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutiang chu a ni Israela thlahte an chhûngkaw chhinchhiahna kenga an kal dân chu; chutiang tak chuan an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Mosia puzawn, Midian mi Reuela fapa Hobaba hnênah Mosian, “ ‘Ka pe ang che u,’ Lalpan a tih hmunah chuan kan kal dâwn a ni a; kan hnênah lo kal ve la, ṭha takin i chungah kan ti ang; Lalpa chuan Israela thlahte chungchâng thu chu ṭha takin a sawi tawh si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ani chuan a hnênah, “Ka lo kal lo mai ang e, keimahni ramah ka laichînte hnênah ka kal zâwk ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Min kalsan lul suh khai, thlalêrah chuan awm hmun kan khuarna tûr i hre zâwk si a, kan tân mit i lo ni dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, kan hnêna i kal ve chuan, a ni, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpan thil ṭha min tihsak ang zêlin kan tihsak ve zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa tlâng aṭanga ni thum kalah chuan an kal a; tin, Lalpa thuthlung bâwm chu an tâna innghahna hmun remchâng zawngin, ni thum an kal chhûng hian an hma a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An bûk ata an chhuahin Lalpa chhûm chu an chungah a awm zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, bâwm chu a chhuah dâwn apiangin Mosian, “Aw Lalpa , lo thawk la, i hmêlmate chu tidarh la, a hawtu che chu i hmaah tlânchhe rawh se,” a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, a innghah apiangin, “Aw Lalpa , Israel mipuiho hnênah hian lo kîr leh rawh,” a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chuan Lalpa beng hriatah phunnawi hmangte angin thil ṭha lo tak an sawi ṭhîn a; chu chu Lalpan a lo hriatin a thin a alh ta a; tichuan, Lalpa mei chu an zîngah chuan a lo thawk a, an riahhmun pâwn lam chu a lo kâng ta dur dur mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite chuan Mosia an au va; tin, Mosia chu Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, mei chu a rêm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi hmun hming chu Tabera an ti a, Lalpa mei chu an zînga a lo thawh avâng chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, an zînga hnam dang nêna inneih pawlhhote chuan tisa châkna an lo nei ta a; Israela thlahte pawh an ṭap leh a, “Tu nge sa ei tûr min pe dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Duh duha Aigupta rama sangha kan ei ṭhinte chu kan hre reng a, fanghma te, hmazil te, purûn hel ei mi te, rûn bâl te, purûn vâr chi te pawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nimahsela, tûnah chuan kan thlîng a ro zo ta, eng mah rêng rêng beisei tûr a awm lo, manna mai lo hi chu,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manna chu koriander mu ang, a lan dânah chuan tuikeplung ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mite chuan an chhar khâwm a, râwtsawmnaah an râwt sawm a, sumah te an dêng a, bêlah an chhûm a, chhangah te an siam a; han ei chuan hriaka kan chhang ang a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Riahhmuna zâna dai a tlâkin manna chu a tla tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu an chhûngkua kuain an puan in kawngka ṭheuhvah an ṭap tih Mosian a lo hria a; tin, Lalpa thin chu nasa takin a alh ta a. Tin, Mosia pawh a lungni lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tichuan Lalpa hnênah, “Eng vângin nge i chhiahhlawh hi mi tihhrehawm? Engtizia nge i mit ka tlun lohva, hêng mipui zawng zawng phurrit hi ka chunga i nghah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hêng mipui zawng zawng hi ka hrin em an nih? An pi leh pute chhechhama pêk i tiam rama hruai lût tûrin, ‘Nau pawmtuin hnute hne lai a pawm angin i ângchhûngah pawm rawh,’ i mi tih atân em ni ka hruai chhuah hlawm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hêng mipui zawng zawng pêk tûr hi khawi ata nge sa ka neih ang? ‘Kan ei atân sa mi pe rawh,’ tia ṭapin mi bei si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêng mipui zawng zawng hi mahni ngawt chuan ka phur zo lo, ka tân a rit lutuk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hetianga mi tih dâwn chuan mi khawngaih la, mi tihlum daih law law mai la, mi tirethei tawh suh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Israel-te upa, mipuite upa leh an hotu nia i hriat mi sawmsarihte kha ka hnênah han hruai khâwm la, inbiakna puan inah nangmah nêna ding ho tûrin han hruai rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, ka lo chhuk ang a, chutah chuan ka rawn bia ang che: tin, nangmaha thlarau chu an chungah ka dah ang a; nangmah chauhva phur lovin mipuite phurrit chu an phurhpui ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, nangin mipui hnênah, ‘Naktûk atân hian intithianghlim vek ula; tichuan, sa chu in ei mawlh ang. “Sa ei tûr tuin nge min pe dâwn? Aigupta rama kan nawm nên khân,” tiin Lalpa beng hriatah in ṭap a; chuvângin, Lalpan sa a pe ang che u a, in ei mawlh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni khat emaw, ni hnih emaw, ni nga emaw, ni sâwm emaw, ni sawmhnih emaw mai pawh ni lovin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />thla khat pumhlûm, ngei hlui khawp leh luak chhuak hlui khawpin in ei ang; in zînga awm Lalpa chu duh lova, “Engati nge Aigupta ram ata kan chhuah ni?, ti-a a hmaah in ṭah avângin,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Mosian, “Ka awmpui mipuiho kea kal thei ṭhiau pawh 6,00,000 an ni a, ‘Thla khat pumhlûm ei tûr sa ka pe ang,’ i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Berâm rual leh ran rual pawh talhsak ila, an khawpkham dâwn em ni? Tuifinriata sangha zawng zawng pawh mansak vek ila, an khawpkham dâwn em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “ Lalpa kut chu a tawi ta em ni? I chungah ka thu angin a thlen leh thlen loh i hre mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chu a chhuak a, Lalpa thu chu mipuite chu a hrilh a; tin, mipuihote upa sawmsarihte chu a ko khâwm a, puan In vêlah chuan a dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chu chhûmah chuan a lo chhuk a, a rawn bia a, amaha Thlarau chu upa sawmsarihte chungah chuan a dah a; tin, heti hi a ni a, Thlarau chu an chunga a han awm veleh chuan thu an sawi ta dual dual a; nimahsela, chutiang chuan an ti an ti leh tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, bûkah chuan mi pahnih an la awm ta a: pakhata hming chu Eldada a ni a, pakhat leha hming chu Medada a ni. Thlarau chu an chungah a awm a. Chhiarte zînga tel chu an ni a, inbiakna puan inah erawh chuan an kal ve lo; bûkah chuan thu an sawi bual bual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, tlangvâl pakhat a va tlân a, Mosia a va hrilh a, “Eldada leh Medadan bûkah thu an sawi bual bual mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Nuna fapa Josua, a tleirâwl tirh aṭanga Mosia rawngbâwltu chuan a chhâng a, “Ka pu Mosi, khap rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Mosian a hnênah, “Keimah avânga ngaimawh em i nih? Lalpa mi zawng zawngte chu zâwlnei ni vek sela, Lalpan an chungah a thlarau chu dah ṭheuh sela tih nâk alaiin.” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chu bûkah chuan a lût leh a, amah leh Israel-ho upate nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa hnên aṭang chuan thli a lo tleh a, tuifinriat lam ata vahmîm a rawn lên a, bûk lehlam pang ni khat kal, a lehlam pang ni khat kal ve ve awhin bûk vêl chuan tawng hnih laia sângin a tlâktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chuan chumi ni nilêng leh zankhua leh, a tûk nilêng chuan vahmîm chu an va chhar khâwm a, a chhar tlêm ber pawhin homer sâwm a chhar a; bûk vêlah chuan mahni tân an pho ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, chumi sa chu an ei lai, an la ei zawh hmain, mipuite chungah Lalpa thin chu a alh ta a, mipuite chu hripui nasa takin Lalpan a hrem ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chumi hmun hmingah chuan Kibroth-hat-tava an ti a; chutah chuan tisa châkna neitute chu an phûm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Kibroth-hat-tava aṭang chuan mipuite chu Hazeroth-ah an kal a; Hazeroth-ah chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Miriami leh Arona chuan Mosian Kus hmeichhia nupuia a neih avangin an sawi chhia a: Kus hmeichhia chu a nei ngei si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Mosia hnênah chauh hian em ni Lalpan thu a sawi bîk? Keini hnênah pawh hian a sawi ve lo vem ni?” an ti a. Chu chu Lalpan a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosia chu lei chunga mihring zawng zawnga zaidam lâwtlak a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona leh Miriami hnênah Lalpan , “In pathumin lo chhuak ula, inbiakna puan inah lo kal rawh u,” a ti ta thut mai a. Tichuan, an pathum chuan an va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu chhûm dingah a lo chhuk a, puan in kawngkaah a lo ding a, Arona leh Miriami chu a ko va; tin, an pahnih chuan an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ka thu hi ngaithla rawh u: in zîngah hian zâwlnei in awm chuan a hnênah kei Lalpa hi inlârnain ka inhriattîr ang a, mang lamah ka bia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh Mosia hi zawng chutiang a ni lo; ka chhûngkaw thu zawng zawngah chuan a rinawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani nên zawng ṭawngkain, thurûk awm lovin tlang takin kan inbia a; Lalpa hmêl pawh a hmu ang; chuvângin, ka chhiahhlawh Mosia hi engtiziaa sawi chhe ngam nge in nih?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chu an chungah a thinur ta êm êm a, a kal leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, puan in chunga chhûm chu a kiang ta a; tin ngai teh, Miriami chu vûr ang maia varin a lo phâr ta a; Arona chuan Miriami chu a han en a, ngai teh, phâr a lo ni ta reng mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Aronan Mosia hnênah, “Aw ka pu, kan chungah sual nghat lul suh ang che, âtthlâk takin kan lo ti a, kan lo sual ta a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi, a nu chhûl ata a lo chhuah tirh aṭanga thi sa deuhthaw angin awm lul suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian, “Aw Pathian, tidam leh teh khai,” tiin Lalpa chu a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “A pain a hmaia chil a chhâk ngawt pawhin ni sarih chu a zak dâwn lâwm ni? Dai pâwnah ni sarih bi bo sela, chumi zawhah hruai luh leh ni rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Miriami chu dai pâwnah ni sarih a bi bo va; Miriami an hruai luh leh hma chuan mipuite chu an tawl sawn lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan mipuite chu Hazeroth ata an chhuak a, Paran thlalêrah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte ka pêk, Kanaan ram va enthla tûrin mite tîr rawh khai: an hnam chhûngkaw tina mi, an puipa zînga mi pakhat ṭheuh zêl i tîr tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Paran thlalêr aṭang chuan Lalpa thupêk angin a kaltîr ta hlawm a, an za chuan Israela thlahte zînga puipa ṭhiau an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng hi an hming a ni: Reuben hnam zînga mi Zakura fapa Samua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simeon hnam zînga mi Horia fapa Saphata;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Juda hnam zînga mi Jephunea fapa Kaleba;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isakar hnam zînga mi Josefa fapa Igala;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim hnam zînga mi Nuna fapa Hosea;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Benjamin hnam zînga mi Raphua fapa Paltia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zebulun hnam zînga mi Sodia fapa Gadiela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Josef hnam (Manase hnam an tih) zînga mi Susia fapa Gadia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dan hnam zînga mi Gemalia fapa Amiela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aser hnam zînga mi Mikaela fapa Sethura;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Napthali hnam zînga mi Vopsia fapa Nabia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gad hnam zînga mi Makia fapa Geuela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hêng hi ram enthla tûra Mosian a tirhate hming chu a ni. Nuna fapa Hosea chu Mosian Josua a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian Kanaan ram enthla tûrin anniho chu a tîr a, an hnênah, “Chhim lam kawngah kal phawt ula, tlângahte lâwn chho ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ram chu eng ang nge tih te, chûnga chêng mipuite chu an chak nge chak lo tih te, an tlêm leh an tam te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />an awmna ram chu a ṭha nge ṭha lo tih te, an awmna khuate chu eng ang nge ni, puan in mai nge kulh nei in tih te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tin, ram chu a chênghnâwng nge hnâwng lo, a ngaw nge ngaw lo tih te va thlithlai ula. Tin, huai takin awm ula, chumi ram theirahte chu rawn hâwn ang che u,” a ti a. Grêp rah hmasa rah hun lai tak a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, an chhuak chho ta a, ram chu Zin thlalêr aṭanga Hamath luhna Rehob thlengin an enthla vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chhim lamah an chho phawt a, Hebron an va thleng a, chutah chuan Anaka thlah Ahiman-ho te, Sesai-ho te, Talmai-ho te an awm a (Hebron chu Aigupta rama Zoan din hma kum sariha din tawh a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Eskol ruam an va thleng a, chuta grêp rah bâwr khat, a ṭang chawpin an sât chhum a; tiangin mi pahnihin an zâwn a. Pawmgranet leh theipuite pawh an hâwn bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chumi hmun chu Eskol ruam an ti a, Israela thlahten chuta ta grêp bâwr chu an sah thlâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, an ram va enthla chu ni sawmli an thang a, an lo haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, Paran thlalêra Kadesh-ah chuan Mosia leh Arona leh Israel mipui zawng zawng hnên chu an lo thleng a, an hnênah leh mipui zawng zawng hnênah chuan thu an rawn thlen a, chumi ram theite chu an entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “I mi tirhna ramah chuan kan kal a, hnute tui leh khawizu luanna a lo ni ngei mai; hei hi a rama thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, a rama mi awmte chu mi chak pui pui an ni a, khuate pawh kulh nei, ropui tak tak a ni; tin, Anaka thlahte pawh kan hmu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amalek-ho chu chhim lam ramah an awm a; Hit-ho te, Jebus-ho te, Amor-ho te chu tlângahte an awm a; tin, Kanaan-hote chu tuifinriat kam leh Jordan lui dungah an awm,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia hmaah Kaleban mipui chu a tingawi ṭhuap a, “I han thawk thuai ang u khai, i han la ang u, kan ngam ngei ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nimahsela, a kalpuite chuan, “Kan han hneh thei hlawm lo vang â, kan aiin an chak si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte hnênah an ram han enthlâk chu, “Kan ram han enthlâk chu a chhûnga chêngte ei zawh hmang a ni; tin, a awmte kan hmuh chu mi âwmkhauh pui pui an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan Anaka thlahte, mi lianho, âwmkhauh pui pui kan hmu a; khau ang lekin kan inhmu a, anni pawhin khau ang lekin min hmu a ni,” tiin, a ṭha lo lamin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, pung khâwmho zawng zawng chu aw chhuah meuhvin an ṭap a; chumi zân chuan mipuite chu an ṭap an ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israela thlahte zawng zawng chu Mosia chungah leh Arona chungah an phunnawi a: pung khâwmho zawng zawng chuan an hnênah, “Aigupta ramah khân Pathianin min tihlum ta thên sela aw! A nih loh leh thlalêrah hian min tihlum thên mai sela aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Engati nge khandaiha thi mai tûra Pathianin he ramah hian min hruai le aw! Kan nupui fanaute chu man tûr mai an ni dâwn si a. Aigupta rama kîr leh hi kan tân a ṭha zâwk dâwn lâwm ni âw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, an inbe hlawm a, “Hotu i siam ang u khai, Aigupta ramah i kîr leh ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia leh Arona chu Israela thlah mipui pung khâwmho zawng zawng hmaah chuan an bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Nuna fapa Josua leh Jephunea fapa Kaleba, ram va enthlatute zînga tel vete chuan an puan an pawt thlêr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israela thlah pung khâwmho zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Enthla tûra kan va fan chhuah ram chu ram ṭha tak a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan chunga Lalpa a lâwm chuan chu ramah chuan min hruai ang a, min pe ang; hnute tui leh khawizu luanna ram chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chungah hel lo phawt mai ula, chumi rama mite chu hlau bawk hek suh u, kan chaw tûr an ni mai a; an inhumhimna chu eng mah lo a ni a, Lalpa chu kan hnênah a awm alâwm. Anni chu hlau suh u,” tiin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, pung khâwmho zawng zawng chuan lunga den an rawt a. Chutichuan, Lalpa ropuina chu inbiakna puan inah Israela thlahte zawng zawng hmaah a lo lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Hêng mipuite hian eng chen nge mi ngaihnêp ang a, an zînga chhinchhiahna ka tih ṭhin chung pawhin eng chen nge mi rin loh dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hriin ka hrem ang a, ka timang ang a, nangmahah hian an aia ropui leh thiltithei zâwk hnam ka din teh zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Lalpa hnênah, “Aigupta miten an hre reu reu vang e; hêng mipuite hi an zîng ata i thiltihtheihnaa i hruai chhuah an ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hemi rama mite hi an hrilh ang a; hêng mipuite zîngah hian i awm tih an hre tawh a; hmaichhan meuhvin an hmu tawh si chia, i chhûm chu an chungah a awm ṭhîn a; tin, chhûnah chhûm ding, zânah meiin an hma i hruai ṭhîn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hêng mipuite hi i tihhlum phiar chuan i hmingthan hretu chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘ Lalpa chuan hêng mipuite hi chhechhama a tiam ramah chuan a hruai theih loh avângin thlalêrah a tihlum a ni,’ tiin an sawi dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘ Lalpa chu thinnel tak, ngilneihna ngah, khawlohna te, bawhchhiatna te ngaidam ṭhîn; thiam lova ruatte chhuah mai ngai lo; pate khawlohna avânga fate, fate fa lehte, chhuan thumna leh chhuan lina thleng pawha hrem ṭhîn a ni,’ tia i lo sawi tawh ang khân i thiltihtheihna chu hlen hrâm teh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I ngilneihna a nasat ang ngei leh Aigupta ram ata tûn thlenga i ngaidam ang hian, mipuite khawlohna hi ngaidam teh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “I thu ang chuan ka ngaidam e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />amaherawhchu, ka nunna leh Lalpa ropuina tihkhah leilung chhâlin ka sawi e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aigupta ram leh thlalêra ka ropuina leh ka thilmak tihte hmua, chuti chung pawha vawi sâwm zet mi la fiaha, ka thu la pawm lo mi zawng zawngte hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />an thlahtute hnêna chhechhama ka tiam ram chu an hmu tawp lo vang a; an zînga mi ngainêptu rêng rêngte pawhin an hmu bawk hek lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ka chhiahhlawh Kaleba erawh hi chuan rilru dang a puta, mi zui tak zet avângin, ani hi chu a va kalna ramah chuan ka hruai ang a, a thlahte chuan an luah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khai le, Amalek-ho leh Kanaan-ho chu ruamah chuan an awm a; naktûkah lêt ula, Tuifinriat Sen kawng lam thlalêrah lût rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Hêng mi suaksual pung khâwmho, ka chunga phunnawi ṭhîn hi eng chen nge ka dawh ang? Israela thlahte phunnawina, ka chunga an phunnawinate chu ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An hnênah, ‘Ka nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka beng hriat ngeia in sawi ang takin in chungah ka ti ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />in ruangte chu he thlalêrah hian a awm ang a; in zînga mi chhiar tawh sa zawng zawng, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam mi ka chunga phunnawiho zawng zawngte chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />bân phar meuhva, ‘ka awmtîr ang che u,’ ka tih ramah chuan Jephunea fapa Kaleba leh Nuna fapa Josua chauh lo chu in lût tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ‘man tûr mai an ni ang,’ in tih in fanaute hi chu ka hruai lût ang a, in duh loh ram chu an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nangni erawh chu in ruang he thlalêrah hian a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />In fate chu thlalêrah kum sawmli an tei an tei ang a, thlalêra in ruangte a riral hma loh chuan in nawhchizawrhna chu an tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ram in va enthlâk ni zât, ni sawmli chu, ni khat aiah kum khat zêl, kum sawmli chhûng zet in bawhchhiatna in tuar phah ang a; tichuan, ka tum dân ka tihdanglam hi in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hian mi suaksual pung khâwm, mi dodâla pung khâwmho chungah hei hi ka ti ngei ang ka lo ti tawh a: hemi thlalêrah hian an boral ang a, chutah chuan an thi ang, Lalpan a ti,’ ti rawh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ram enthla tûra Mosia tirh lo kîr leh, ram chanchin a ṭha lo zâwnga rawn sawia, a chunga pung khâwmho phunnawitîrtu, ram a ṭha lo zâwnga rawn sawitute chu Lalpa hmaah hriin an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ram enthla tûra kalte zînga Nuna fapa Josua leh Jephunea fapa Kaleba erawh chu an thi ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian chûng thûte chu Israela thlahte zawng zawng chu a hrilh a, mipuite chu an lungngai ta hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, zîng takah an tho va, tlâng chhîpah an han chho va, “Ngai teh, hei kan lo kal e, Lalpan min tiamna hmunah chuan kan kal ang e, kan lo sual ta a ni e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Mosian, “Hmuingîlna a ni lo vang tih hre reng chungin engah nge Lalpa thupêk in bawhchhiat teh rêng?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />In zîngah Lalpa a awm si lo va, hmêlmate lo tihhlum mai tûrin chho suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />In hmaah khian Amalek-ho leh Kanaan-ho an awm a ni, khandaiha tihhlum in ni mai ang; Lalpa chu in hawisan tâk avângin in hnênah Lalpa chu a awm lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nimahsela, tlang chhîpah chuan kal an tum ṭâlh a. Amaherawhchu, Lalpa thuthlung bâwm leh Mosia chu bûk ata an chhuak ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chutichuan, chumi tlânga awm Amalek-ho leh Kanaan-ho chu an lo chhuk a, an bei a, Horma thlengin an vaw thlu rum mai a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte bia la, an hnênah, ‘In awmna tûr ram ka pêk che u in thlen huna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa hnêna meia thilhlan, hâlral thilhlan emaw, thutiam hlen tûra inthawina emaw, mahni duh thûa thilhlan emaw, in kût hunbiah emaw, ran rual zinga mi emaw, berâm rual zînga mi emawa Lalpa tâna rimtui siam tûr emawa in hlan hun chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa hnêna a thilhlan hlântu apiangin chhangphut thilhlan, chhangphut dip mi epha hmun sawma ṭhena hmun khat, hriak hin hmun lia ṭhena hmun khata hmeh a hlân tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, in tûr thilhlanah uain hin hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat hâlral thilhlan emaw, inthawina emawa hlannaah berâmno hming kimin in buatsaih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, berâmpaah chuan chhangphut thilhlan, chhangphut dip mi epha hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun hnih, hriak hin hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khata hmeh in buatsaih tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tin, in tûr thilhlanah chuan Lalpa tâna rimtuiah uain hin hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hâlral thilhlanah emaw, thutiam hlen tûra inthawinaah emaw, Lalpa hnêna remna thilhlanah emawa bâwngpa in buatsaih hun chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />bâwngpa hlan rual chuan chhangphut thilhlan chhangphut dip mi epha hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun thum hriak hin chanvea hmeh in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, in tûr thilhlanah uain hin chanve, Lalpa tâna rimtui meia thilhlan in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutiang chuan bâwngpa te, berâmpa te, berâmno a pa te, kêlno te an hming kimin tih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An tam dân azir zêlin in buatsaih ang a, an tam dân ang zêl chuan in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chumi rama piang zawng zawng chuan hetiang zêl hian, Lalpa tâna rimtui meia thilhlan an hlan hunin an ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, hnam dang mi in hnêna khawsa ṭhîn emaw, tu pawh in hnêna khawsa zêl ṭhîn tûrte emaw, Lalpa tâna rimtui meia thilhlan hlân duh apiang chuan in tih ang takin an ti ve tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In thlahte thleng atân mipuite leh hnam dang in hnêna awmte tân pawh, dân ang khat chauh a awm tûr a ni; Lalpa hmaah hnam dangte chu nangmahni ang chiah an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In tân leh in hnêna hnam dang awmte tân dân thuhmun leh tih dân thuhmun khat chauh a awm ang,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Israela thlahte bia la, an hnênah, ‘Heti hi a ni ang a, ka hruaina tûr che u ram in va thlena,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />chumi ram chhang in ei hun chuan Lalpa hnênah thên thilhlan in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In chhang hmeh hmasak ber zînga mi hlâwm khat chu thên thilhlanah in hlân tûr a ni; hruiha mi thên thilhlanah in thên angin in thên tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In thlahte thlengin in chhang hmeh hmasak ber chu Lalpa hnêna thên thilhlan atân in hlân zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, hêng thupêk zawng zawng, Lalpan Mosia hnêna a sawi, Lalpan thu a pêk tirh aṭanga in thlahte thleng atâna Mosia hmanga thu a pêk zawng zawng che u hi, in pawm lohva, in bawhchhiat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />hetiang hi a ni ang a, pung khâwmhovin hre lova tihpalh a nih chuan, pung khâwmho zawng zawng chuan hâlral thilhlan Lalpa tâna rimtuiah bâwngtuai pakhat an hlân ang a, a dân pangngai angin chhangphut thilhlan leh in tûr thilhlan nên, sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat an hlân tel bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, puithiamin Israela thlah pung khâwm zawng zawng tân remna a siam ang a, ngaihdam an ni ang, tihpalh a nih avâng leh an thilhlan, Lalpa tâna meia thilhlan leh an tihsual aiah sual thawina an hlan tâk avângin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israela thlah pung khâwm zawng zawngte chu ngaihdam an ni ang a, an zînga hnam dang awmte pawh; mipui zawng zawngin an tihpalh a nih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, miin hre lova thil a tihsual chuan sual thawi nân kêlnu pakhat kum khat mi a hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hre lova Lalpa hmaa tisualtu tân chuan puithiamin remna a siam tûr a ni; tichuan, ngaihdam a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hre lova tisualtu tân, Israela thlah, chu rama piangte tân leh hnam dang mi an zînga awmte tân pawh dân ang khat in nei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hre reng sia tilui chu, chu rama piang emaw, hnam dang emaw pawh ni sela, Lalpa sawi chhia a ni a; chu mi chu a chipuite zîng ata tuithlâr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu a hmuhsita, a thupêk chu a bawhchhiat avângin chu mi chu tuithlâr hlauh tûr a ni a, a khawlohna mawh chu a phur ang,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israela thlahte thlalêra an awm lai chuan mi pakhat, Chawlhnia thing fawm hi an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A thing fawm hmutute chuan Mosia leh Arona leh mipuiho hnênah chuan an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Engtia tih tûr nge tih la puan loh a nih avângin tân inah an khung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Chu mi chu tihhlum ngei ngei tûr a ni, daipâwnah mipui zawng zawng chuan lungin an dêng tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang chuan mipui zawng zawng chuan daipâwnah an hruai a, lungin an dêng hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Israela thlahte hnênah an thlahte thlenga an puan hmâwrah a fêm siam tûr leh, a hmâwr tin fêmah a dumpâwl dah tûrin ti rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />chumi fêm chu in en ṭhina, Lalpa thupêk zawng zawng in hriat renga in zawm nân leh, nawhchizuara in awm ṭhin anga in thinlung duh zâwng leh, in mit la zâwng ûma in awm loh nân leh, ka thupêk zawng zawngte chu in hriat renga, in zawma, in Pathian tâna in thianghlim theih nân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />In Pathian ni tûra Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu che u Lalpa in Pathian ka ni. Kei hi Lalpa in Pathian chu ka ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levia fapa Kohatha, chu mi fapa Izara, chu mi fapa Kora chu Eliaba fapate, Dathana leh Abirama leh Peletha fapa Ona, Reubena thlahte nên chuan mite an hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israela thlahte, mi lâr deuh deuh mipui zînga hotu, rorêltua thlante zînga mi zahnih leh sawmngate nên, Mosia hmaah an va thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona phiarin an pung khâwm a, an hnênah, “In induh êm mai, mipuite chu an thianghlim ṭheuh si a, Lalpa pawh an zîngah a awm si a. Eng vângin nge Lalpa mipui pung khâwmho chunga in indah chungnun bîk?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu chu Mosian a han hriat chuan a bawkkhup a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, Kora leh a pâwlte zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Naktuk zîngah Lalpan a tate leh a thianghlimte chu tilangin amah va hnaih tûrin a ti ang a, a thlante ngei chu amah va hnaih tûrin a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang, Kora leh i pâwlte zawng zawng chuan heti hian ti rawh u: naktûkah mei lâknate keng ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chutah chuan mei dah ula, Lalpa hmaah rimtui phul rawh u; tin, Lalpan a thlan apiang chu a thianghlim ang. Levia fapate u, in induh êm mai,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Kora hnênah, “Nangni Levia fapate u, ngaithla rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa biak bûka rawngbâwla, mipuite hmaa an rawngbâwla ding tûra Israel-te Pathianin amah hnaih tûra Israel mipuite zîng ata a tihhran che u leh, Levia fapa in unaute zawng zawng nêna amah hnaih tûra a awmtîr che u hi, thil tê thamah in ngai a ni maw, puithiam nihna in la zawn cheu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan nang leh i pâwlte zawng zawng Lalpa dodâlin in pung khâwm a ni. Tin, Arona hian eng nge maw a tiha, a chungah hian in phunnawi?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Eliaba fapa Dathana leh Abirama a kohtîr a; anni chuan, “Kan lo chho lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />thlalêra mi tihlum tûrin hnute tui leh khawizu luanna ram ata min hruai chhuak hi thil tê tham em ni? Kan chungah i intilal lehnghâl si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hnutetui leh khawizu luanna ramah min hruai lût lo va, lo leh grêp huan ro tûr min pe bawk hek lo. Hêngho mitte hi chawl i phulsak dâwn em ni? Kan lo chho lo tawp ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chu a thin a rim ta hle mai a, Lalpa hnênah, “An thilhlan chu pawm suh. An sabengtung pakhat mah ka la lo va, tu mah ka tina hek lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Kora hnênah chuan, “Naktûkah nang leh i mi pung khâwmho, nang nên, anni nên, Arona nên Lalpa hmaah lo awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An mei lâkna keng ṭheuh sela, rimtui phul sela, Lalpa hmaah mei lâkna ṭheuh, mei lâkna 250 chu rawn keng rawh se; nang leh Arona pawhin in mei lâkna keng ve ve rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, mi tinin an mei lâkna chu an keng a, mei an dah a, rimtui an phul a, Mosia leh Arona-te nên inbiakna puan in kawngkaah chuan an va ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Kora chuan mipui zawng zawng chu anmahni dodâlin, inbiakna puan in kawngkaah chuan a awm khâwmtîr a; tin, mipui zawng zawng chungah chuan Lalpa ropuina a lo lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona chu a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Hêng mipui zîng ata hi inthiarfihlîm rawh u, ka rawn tihboral thut theih nân,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, anni chu an bawkkhup a “Aw Pathian, nunna zawng zawng hnâr i ni, mi pakhat sual avângin mipui zawng zawng chungah i thinur dâwn em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mipuite hnênah chuan, ‘Kora te, Dathana te, Abirama te hi bûk ata kiansan vek rawh u,’ tiin sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chu a tho va, Dathana leh Abirama-te hnênah chuan a va kal a, Israel-ho upate chuan an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, pung khâwmho hnênah chuan, “Hêng mi sualho puan in a ṭangte hian chhuak rawh u khai; an eng mah hi khawih suh u; chuti lo chuan, an sualna zawng zawngah hian in tel ve dah ang e,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, Kora te, Dathana te, Abirama te bûk ata chu an chhuak ta sung sung mai a; tin, Dathana leh Abirama chu an puan in ata an lo chhuak a, an puan in kawngkaah chuan an nupui te, an fapa te, an fanau tê tête nên an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Mosian, “Keima rilru puakchhuaka tih a ni lo va, hêng thil ti tûr hian Lalpan mi tîr a ni tih hemiah hian in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hêng mite hi mi zawng zawng thih dân ang mai bawka an thiha, mi zawng zawng hrem ang bawka hrem an nih chuan Pathianin mi tîr lo a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Lalpan thil thar a siama, leiin a kâ a âna, anmahni leh an ta zawng zawng a lema, Seol-ah a nunga an luh erawh chuan hêng mite hian Lalpa an lo ngainêp a ni tih in hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng thu zawng zawng chu a sawi zawh chuan, an hnuai lei chu a lo khi chat ta phuk mai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tichuan, lei chuan a kâ a âng a, an chhûngkuain Kora mite zawng zawng, an bungrua zawng zawng nên a lem ta vek hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, anmahni leh an ta zawng zawng chu Seol-ah chuan a nung chungin an pil ta vek a, lei chuan a kâ a chîp hnan a, pung khâwm zîng ata chu an boral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tichuan, an vêla Israel mi zawng zawngte chu an au thâwmah chuan an tlân darh a, “Leiin min lem ve dah reu reu vang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa aṭangin mei a lo chhuak a, rimtui hlântu mi zahnih leh sawmngate chu a rawn kâng hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Nangin mei chu tidarh la, puithiam Arona fapa Eleazara chu mei ata mei lâkna chu la chhuak tûrin hrilh rawh, thil thianghlim a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Anmahni nunna chunga sualho mei lâknate pawh chu la la, maichâm khuhna thlêngah chher ni rawh se. Lalpa hmaa hlan a ni a; chuvângin, a thianghlim a ni; chu chu Israela thlahte tâna chhinchhiahna a ni ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Eleazara chuan kângho dâr mei lâknate chu a la a, Israela thlahte tâna hriat rengna te, Arona thlah ni lo hnam dang rêng rêng, Lalpa hmaa rimtui hâl tûra an kal hnaih loh nân te, Kora leh a pâwlte anga an awm loh nân te, Mosia hmanga a hnêna Lalpan a sawi ang chuan maichâm khuh nân an chher ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nimahsela, a tûkah chuan, “ Lalpa mite in tihlum a ni,” tiin Israela thlah mipui zawng zawng chu Mosia leh Arona chungah an phunnawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Mosia leh Arona chunga mipui an pun khâwm lai chuan inbiakna puan in lam chu an hawi a; tin, ngai teh, chhûmin a rawn khuh a, Lalpa ropuina a lo lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona chu inbiakna puan in kawtah chuan an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Hêng mipui zîng ata hi inthiarfihlîm rawh u, ka rawn tihboral thut theih nân,” tiin. Tin, anni chu an bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Arona hnênah, “I mei lâkna keng la, maichâm ata mei dah la, rimtui phul la, mipui hnênah kalpui thuai la, an tân remna siam rawh; Lalpa hnên ata thinurna a lo chhuak a ni. Hri a lêng ṭan mêk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, Arona chuan Mosia sawi ang chuan a keng a, pungho zîngah chuan a tlân lût a; tin, ngai teh, hri chu mipui zîngah chuan a lo lêng ṭan tawh a. Tin, rimtui chu a phul a, mipui tân chuan remna a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Mitthi leh mi nung inkârah a ding a, hri chu a kiang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tichuan, Kora chungchâng thûa thite tiam lovin, hri-a thi zawng zawng chu sîngkhat leh sângli leh zasarih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, Arona chu inbiakna puan in kawngkaa Mosia hnênah chuan a lêt leh a; tichuan, hri chu a kiang ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte bia la, an chhûngkaw tin pualah tiang pakhat ṭheuh zêl, an chhûngkaw zir zêla an puipate zawng zawng zât, tiang sâwm leh pahnih la la; tin, an tiangah chuan an hming ṭheuh ziak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Levia tiangah chuan Arona hming ziak ang che: an chhûngkaw tin atân tiang pakhat zêl a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, kan inbiakna, inbiakna puan in thuhriattîrna hmaah chuan i dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, ka mi thlan tûra tiang chu a chawr ang a; tichuan, Israela thlahte phunnawina, i chunga an phunnawina hi ka tireh dâwn a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia chuan Israela thlahte chu a bia a, an puipate zawng zawng chuan an chhûngkaw tin pualah, puipa tinin tiang pakhat zêl, tiang sâwm leh pahnih an pe a: Arona tiang pawh chu an tiang zîngah chuan a tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian thuhriattîrna puan inah Lalpa hmaah tiangte chu a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan Mosia chu thuhriattîrna puan inah chuan a va kal a; tin, ngai teh, Levi chhûngkaw puala Arona tiang chu a lo chawr a, a kuhmûm a, a pâr a, vaiumkhal a lo rah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Lalpa hma ata tiang zawng zawng chu Israel-hote hnênah a la chhuak a; an lo en a, anmahni tiang ṭheuh chu an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Helhmang fate an ni tih hriattîr ṭhîn nân Arona tiang chu thuhriattîrna bulah dah leh rawh; tichuan, ka chunga an helna hi i tihrehsak thei dâwn nia, an thih loh nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Mosia chuan a ti a; Lalpan thu a pêk ang chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Mosia hnênah, “Ngai teh, kan boral a ni alâwm, kan chhe zo ta, kan chhe zo vek alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa biak bûk rawn hnaih apiangte chu an thi zêl a; kan boral vêk dâwn em ni ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Arona hnênah, “Nang leh i fapate leh in chhûngkua hian hmun thianghlim bawhchhiatna mawh chu in phur ang a, puithiamho bawhchhiatna mawh erawh chu nangmah ngei leh i fate chauhvin an phur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Levia chi, i pa chi, i unauten an zawm ve chia, rawng an bâwl theih nân i kiang hnaiah awmtîr la; amaherawhchu, nang leh i fapate chu thuhriattîrna puan in bulah in awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I hna an puibâwm ang chia, puan in lam hna zawng zawng an chang ang a; amaherawhchu, hmun thianghlim bungbêl leh maichâm chu rawn hnaih suh se, an thih loh nân, anni emaw, nang emaw pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni chuan an kawp ang chia, puan in lam hna zawng zawngah inbiakna puan in hna chu an chang ang a; hnam dang chuan an rawn hnaih tûr che u a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, nangin hmun thianghlim hna leh maichâm hna chu i chang ang, Israela thlahte chunga thinurna a awm tawh loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, kei hian i unau Levi-hote chu Israela thlahte zîng ata ka thlang chhuak a, inbiakna puan in rawngbâwl tûra Lalpa hnêna pêk, i tâna thilpêk an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, nang leh i fapate hian maichâm leh puanzâr chhûng lam thûah in puithiam hna chu in thawk ang; tin, nangin rawng i bâwl ang. Puithiam hna hi in rawngbâwl hna atân ka pe che u a; hnam dang rawn inrawlh ve apiang erawh chu tihhlum an ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Arona a bia a, “Ngai teh, kei hian ka tâna thên thilhlan, Israela fate thilhlan zawng zawngte lain nang leh i fapaten kumkhuaa in chanpual atân ka pe che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meia hâl bâng thil thianghlimte chu i ta a ni ang a: an thilhlan tinrêng - an chhangphut thilhlante, an sual thawina thilhlante, an thiam loh thawina thilhlan ka hnêna an hlan tûrte lamin nang leh i fapate pual a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil thianghlim eiin chumi chu in ei ang a, mipa zawngin an ei ang a; i pual a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hêng hi i pual a ni ang: chhangphut thilhlana an thilpêk, Israela thlahte thên thilhlan zawng zawngte lamin; nang leh i fapate leh i fanute nên in kumkhaw chanpualah ka pe che u a ni. I ina mi thianghlim zawng zawngin an ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hriak ṭha ber te, grêp ṭha ber te, buh ṭha ber te, rah hmasa ber Lalpa tâna an pêk te chu ka pe a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An lova rah hmin hmasa ber Lalpa tâna an rawn lâk chu i ta a ni ang a; i ina mi thianghlim zawng zawngin an ei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel-ho thilhlan zawng zawng chu i ta a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa tâna an pêk, chhûl keu hmasa ber apiang chu, mihring pawh, ran pawh i ta a ni ang a; amaherawhchu, fa tîr chu i tlan ngei tûr a ni ang a, ran thianghlim lo no piang thla hmasa ber pawh chu i tlan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thla khat a nihin tlan tûrte chu tlanna man i ruat dân angin, hmun thianghlima hman sekel ngain i tlan tûr a ni (sekel chu gera sawmhnih a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, bâwngpa piang thla hmasa ber te, berâm piang thla hmasa ber te, kêl piang thla hmasa ber te chu i tlan tûr a ni lo; an thianghlim a ni. An thisen chu maichâmah i theh ang a, Lalpa tâna rimtuiah an thaute chu meia thilhlanah i hâl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An sa chu i ta a ni ang, thên thilhlan irâwm leh a bawp ding lam i ta a ni ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thil thianghlima thên thilhlan, Israela thlahten Lalpa tâna an hlante chu in kumkhaw chanpual atân ka pe che u a ni; Lalpa hmaa nang leh i fapate leh i fanute nêna chatuan chi thuthlung a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Arona hnênah, “An ramah chuan rochan in nei lo vang a, an zîngah chanvo in nei ve hek lo vang; Israela thlahte zînga i chanvo leh i rochan chu keimah hi ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Levia thlahte chu ngai teh, rawngbâwl hnaa an rawngbâwl hna, puan in rawngbâwl hnaa an rawngbâwl manah Israel rama sâwma pakhat zawng zawng hi ka pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tûn achinah chuan Israela thlahte chuan inbiakna puan in chu an rawn hnaih tûr a ni lo; sual mawh phurin an thi dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Levi-ho hi erawh chuan inbiakna puan in rawngbâwl hna an thawk ang a, a mawh engkim an phur ang; hei hi i thlahte chen atâna dân a ni ang a, Israela thlahte zingah rochan an nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israela thlahten sâwma pakhat Lalpa tâna thên thilhlanah an hlan chu Levi-ho rochan atân ka pe a ni; chuvâng chuan an hnênah, ‘Israela thlahte zîngah rochan an nei lo vang,’ ka lo ti tawh rêng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Chûng thu lovah pawh chuan, Levi-ho chu bia la, an hnênah, ‘In rochan atâna Israela thlahte sâwma pakhat ka pêk che u an lak ata in dawn hun chuan, chumi sâwma pakhat ata sâwma pakhat chu Lalpa hnênah thên thilhlanah in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, in thên thilhlan chu hruia buh leh uain haw hmasa bera ngaih a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Israela thlahte laka sâwma pakhat in dawn zawng zawnga mi chu, Lalpa tâna thên thilhlanah in hlân ve zêl bawk tûr a ni a; tin, chumi Lalpa thên thilhlan chu puithiam Arona in pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />In thil dawn zawng zawnga mi chu a ṭha ber, a thianghlim ber zêl Lalpa thên thilhlanah in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuvângin, an hnênah, chumia ṭha ber in thên hun chuan Levi-ho hruiha hâwng leh uain hâwng anga ngaih a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khawiah pawh in ei thei ang, nangni leh in chhûngte pawhin; inbiakna puan ina in rawngbâwl man a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A ṭha ber in thên chuan a sual mawh in phur lo vang a, Israela thlahte thil thianghlim chu in tibawrhbâng lo vang a, in thi dâwn lo nia,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hei hi Lalpa thupêk dân chu a ni, ‘Israela thlahte chu bâwngla sen hmêlhem lo, sawisêl bo, nghâwngkawl la bel hauh loh rawn kai tûrin hrilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puithiam Eleazara i pe ang a; tin, anin dai pâwnah a hruai chhuak ang a, a hmaah tuin emaw a tihlum tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tin, puithiam Eleazara chuan a kut zungṭangin a thisen chu a la ang a, inbiakna puan in hma lamah a thisen chu vawi sarih a theh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, tuin emaw bâwngla chu a mit hmuhah a hâl ang a; a vun te, a sa te, a thisen te, a êk te nên a hâl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, puithiamin sidar thing leh husop leh lazai sen a la ang a, bâwngla an hâlah chuan a paih lût tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan a silhfênte a su ang a, a inbual ang a, chumi zawhah chuan riahhmunah a kal ang a; tlai lam thlengin puithiam chu a thianghlim lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a hâltu chuan a silhfênte a su ang a, a inbual ang a, tlai lam thlengin a thianghlim lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, mi bawrhbâng lovin bâwngla vâp chu a la khâwm ang a, daipâwn hmun faiah a dah ang a, Israela thlah mipuite tâna inthenna tuiah hman tûr a ni; chu chu sual thawina a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, bâwngla vâp tikhâwmtu chuan a silhfênte a su ang a, tlai lam thlengin a thianghlim lo vang. Hei hi Israela thlahte tân leh hnam dang an hnêna awmte tân kumkhaw dân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu ruang pawh a dektu apiang chu ni sarih an thianghlim lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu mi chu ni thum nîah leh ni sarih nîah a inthian ang a; tichuan, a lo thianghlim ang. Amaherawhchu, ni thum nîah leh ni sarih nîah a inthen loh chuan a thianghlim lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu pawhin tu ruang pawh a deha, a inthen loh chuan Lalpa biak bûk a tibawlhhlawh a ni. Chu mi chu Israel mite zîng ata tuithlâr tûr a ni. Inthenna tui chu a chungah theh loh a nih avângin a thianghlim lo vang; a thianghlim lohna chu a chhûngah a la awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi, puan ina a thih chuan hei hi a tih dân tûr chu a ni: puan ina lût apiang leh puan in chhûnga awm apiangte chu ni sarih an thianghlim lo vang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tin, bungbêl inhawng, a chhinnaa chhin loh apiang chu a bawlhhlawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, tu pawhin tâmlakah khandaiha thah emaw, awmlaia thi ruang emaw, mihring ruh emaw, thlân emaw a deh chuan ni sarih a thianghlim lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a thianghlim lote pualah sual thawina vâp chu an la ang a, bêlah tuikhur tui nên an chhûng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, mi thiangin husop a la ang a, tuiah chuan a hnim ang a, puan in te, bungbêl zawng zawng te, chuta mi awm zawng zawng te, ruh emaw, thah ruang emaw, mitthi ruang emaw, thlân emaw khawihtute chu a theh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi thiangin ni thum ni leh ni sarih nîah mi thianghlim lo chu a theh ang a; ni sarih nîah a tithianghlim ang a; a silhfênte a su ang a, a inbual ang a, tlai lamah chuan a lo thianghlim tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi thianghlim lo inthian lo erawh chuan Lalpa hmun thianghlim a tihbawlhhlawh avângin, chu mi chu pung khâwmho zîng ata tuithlâr tûr a ni. Inthenna tui chuan theh loh a ni a; a thianghlim lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hei hi an tân kumkhaw dân tûr a ni: inthenna tuia theh apiang chuan an silhfênte an su ang a; tin, inthenna tui khawih apiang chu tlai lam thlengin an thianghlim lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, mi thianghlim lovin a khawih apiang chu a thianghlim lo zêl ang a; tin, chu mi khawihtu apiangte chu tlai lam thlengin an thianghlim lo vang,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlah, pung khâwmho zawng zawngte chu thla khatnaah chuan Zin thlalêrah an lût a, mipuite chuan Kadesh-ah awm hmun an khuar a; chutah chuan Miriami chu a thi a, chutah chuan an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, pung khâwmho chuan tui an nei ta lo va; Mosia leh Arona chungchâng thûah an inpun khâwm chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, mipui chuan, “ Lalpa hmaa kan unaute an thih lai khân Pathianin min lo tihlum ve ta thên zâwk sela aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engati nge Lalpa mipuihote hi thi tûra thlalêrah hian i hruai luh ni, keimahni leh kan rante nên?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eng vângin nge he ram ṭha lo taka min hruai lût tûrin Aigupta ram ata min tihchhuah ni? Buhbâl te, theipui te, grêp kûng te, pawmgranet te awm lohna hmun a ni a, tui in tûr rêng rêng lah a awm hek lo,” tiin Mosia chu an bei vak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh Arona chu mipui zîng ata chu inbiakna puan in kawngkaah an kal a, an bawkkhup a; tin, Lalpa ropuina an hnênah a lo lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpan Mosia chu a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tiang la la; pung khâwmhote chu awm khâwmtîr la, nang leh i unau Arona nên. An mit hmuhah lungpui chu a tui tichhuak tûrin hrilh la, lungpui ata chu tui i lâk chhuahsak ang a; tichuan, pung khâwmho leh an rante chu i intîr dâwn nia,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia chuan Lalpa hma ata tiang chu a thupêk ang chuan a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona chuan pung khâwmho chu lungpui bulah chuan an awm khâwmtîr a, an hnênah, “Helhmanghote u, ngai teh u, he lungpui ata hi tui kan lâk chhuahsak dâwn che u em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan a bân a phar a, lungpui chu a tiang chuan vawi hnih a han vua a; tichuan, tui a lo chhuak ta dur dur mai a, pung khâwmhote leh an rante chuan an in ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona hnênah chuan, “Mi rin lohva, Israela thlahte mit hmuha mi chawimawi loh avângin, hêng pung khâwmho hi ka pêk ramah chuan in hruai lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hei hi Meriba tuite chu a ni; Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa chu an bei vak a, chutah chuan chawimawia a awm tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Kadesh aṭangin Edom lal hnênah mi a tîr a, “I unaupa Israela chuan heti hian a ti, ‘Kan chunga tuarna lo thleng zawng zawng hi i hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kan pi leh pute Aigupta rama an chhuka, rei tak Aigupta rama kan awm te, Aigupta miten keini leh kan pi leh pute ṭha lo taka min tih ziate kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa kan au va, kan aw chu a lo hria a, vântirhkoh a rawn tîr a, Aigupta ram ata min hruai chhuak a; tin, ngai teh, i ram dep ber khua Kadesh-ah kan awm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawngaih takin i ram hi kan kal tlang teh ang. Lo emaw, grêp huanah emaw kan kal lo vang a, tuichhunchhuah tuite kan in hek lo vang; Lal Lamlianah kan kal zêl ang a, i ram kan pelh hma loh chuan ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw kan pêng lo vang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Edoma chuan a hnênah, “Mi pal tlang tûr a ni lo, mi pal chuan a bei tûr chein khandaih nên ka lo thawk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israela thlahte chuan a hnênah, “Lamlianah kan kal chho vang a; tin, keimahni leh kan ranin i tui kan in chuan a man chu kan pe ang che; thil dang eng mah ti lovin a kalin kan kal tlang mai ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Kal lo vang,” a ti a. Tichuan, Edoma chu mipui tam tak nên, mi chak takte nên anmahni bei tûrin a lo thawk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edoma chuan Israel mite chu a rama kal a phal ta lo va; tichuan, Israel mite chuan an kîrsan leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Kadesh aṭangin an chhuak a; Israela thlah, mipuiho zawng zawng chuan Hor tlâng an va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia leh Arona chu, Edom ram dep Hor tlângah chuan a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Arona chu a chipuite hnênah hruai a ni ang; Meriba tuiahte khân ka thu dodâla in hel avâng khân Israela thlahte ka pêk ramah chuan a lût dâwn lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Arona leh a fapa Eleazara chu Hor tlângah rawn hruai chho rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Arona chu a silhfênte hlihsak la, a fapa Eleazara bel rawh; Arona chu a chipuite hnênah hruai a ni ang a, chutah chuan a thi ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Lalpa thupêk ang chuan a ti a, mipui zawng zawng mit hmuhah Hor tlângah chuan an chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chuan Arona chu a silhfênte a hlihsak a, a fapa Eleazara a bel a; tin, Arona chu tlâng chhîpah chuan a thi ta a. Tichuan, Mosia leh Eleazara chu tlâng ata chu an chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, mipui zawng zawng chuan Arona a thi tih an hriat chuan, Israel-ho zawng zawng chuan ni sawmthum an sûn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Kanaan mi, Arad lal Chhim lama awmin Israel mite Atharim kawngah an lo kal tih sawi thâwm a hria a; tichuan, Israel mite chu a bei a, salahte a man nual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chuan Lalpa hnênah thu an tiam a, “Hêng mite hi kan kuta min pêk chuan an khuate hi kan tiboral hlauh ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpan Israel mite thu chu a pawm a, Kanaan mite chu a pe a, anmahni leh an khuate chu an tiboral hlauh va; a hmun hmingah chuan Horma an vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Hor tlâng aṭang chuan Tuifinriat Sen lamah Edom ram kal hualin an kal a; kawng a kual avângin mipuite rilru chu a lungni lo hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mipuite chuan Pathian leh Mosia kalhin, “Thlalêra thi tûrin engati nge Aigupta ata min hruai chhuah? Chhang awm hlei lo, tui pawh awm hlei lo; he chhang tenawm pawh hi kan nunnain a ten tawh a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan mipui zîngah chuan rûl chuk na mite a tîr a, mite a chu a, Israel mite tam tak an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, mite chu Mosia hnênah an kal a. “ Lalpa leh nangmah kalhin kan lo ṭawng ta hi kan lo sual ta a ni e, kan zînga rûlte hi tibo tûrin Lalpa hnênah ṭawngṭai rawh khai,” an ti a; tichuan, mite chu Mosia chuan a ṭawngṭaisak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Rûl chuk na mi, a lem siam la, banah khai rawh; tin, heti hi a ni ang a, rûl chuk apiangin chu chu an en chuan an dam ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosian dâr rûl a siam a, banah a khai a; tin, heti hi a ni a, rûl chuk apiangin dâr rûl chu an enin an dam zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chu an kal ta zêl a, Oboth-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Oboth aṭang chuan an kal leh a, ni chhuahna lam Moab thlalêr bul Iye-abarim-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan an kal leh a, Zered ruamah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan an kal leh a, Amor-ho ramri aṭanga lo filawr thlalêra Arnon lehlam pangah awm hmun an khuar a; Arnon chu Moab ramri, Moab leh Amor-ho inkâra awm a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Indonate Buah chuan “Supha-a Vaheb, Arnon ruamte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ar awmna lama thle Moab rama innghat Ruam awihtlân pangpêrte chu,” tia sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Beer-ah an kal leh a; chu chu Lalpan Mosia hnêna, “Mipuite chu ko khâwm la, tui ka pe ang e,” a tihna tuichhunchhuah chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, he hla hi Israel-ten an sa a: “Aw tuikhur, lo chik chhuak la, zaiin chawi la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalten an laih tuikhur chu. An lal tiang leh an talhtuma Mipuite mi lianho laih chu.” Tin, thlalêr aṭang chuan Matana-ah an kal leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tin, Matana aṭangin Nahaliel-ah, Nahaliel aṭang chuan Bamoth-ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bamoth aṭang chuan Moab lova ruam leh thlalêr zuk chhuk en Pisga chhîpah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chuan Amor-ho lal Sihona hnênah, “I ramah hian min kal tlangtîr rawh khai. Lovah emaw, grêp huanah emaw kan pêng lo vang a; tuichhunchhuah tuite chu kan in lo vang. I ram kan pelh hma loh chuan Lal Lamlianah kan kal zêl ang e,” tiin mi an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, Sihona chuan Israel mite chu a rama kal tlang a phal lo va. Tichuan, Sihona chuan a mite zawng zawng chu a khâwm vek a, Israel mite bei tûrin thlalêrah chuan an thawk chhuak ta zâwk a, Jahaz a va thleng a; tin, Israel mite chu a bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chuan khandaihin an bei a, a ram chu Arnon aṭanga Jabok thlengin, Amona thlahte thleng hialin an neihsak a; Amona thlahte ram chu kulha hung tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chuan chûng khua zawng zawngte chu an la a; tichuan, Israel mite chu Amor-ho khua zawng zawngahte chuan an awm a, Hesbon leh a khawper zawng zawngahte pawh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hesbon khua chu Amor-ho lal Sihona khua a ni a, ani chu chumi hmaa Moab lal lo beia a kut ata a ram zawng zawng, Arnon thlenga lâksaktu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvângin, hlaa phuahtute chuan, “Hesbon-ah lo kal ula, Sihona khawpui chu din leh tihngheh ni se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hesbon aṭangin mei a chhuak a, Sihona khawpui aṭangin mei alh; Moab-a Ar a kâng zo va, Arnon hmun sâng lalhote chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />I chung a pik e, Moab! In boral ta, aw Kemos mi! A fapate chu tlân bo atân, A fanute salah a pe, Amor-ho lal Sihona hnênah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kan han kâp a, Hesbon a boral, Dibon thlengin, Nopha thlengin kan tiṭiau, chu chuan Medeba a thleng,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutiang chuan a ni, Amor-ho ramah Israel mite chu an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Jazer va thlîthlai tûrin mi a tîr a, chuta khuate chu an la a, Amor-ho awmte chu an hnawt chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, an lêt a, Basan kawng lamah an chho va. Tin, Basan lal Oga chu anmahni bei tûrin, amah leh a mite zawng zawng, Edrei-a lo bei tûrin a thawk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Amah chu hlau suh; amah pawh, a mite zawng zawng pawh, a ram pawh i kutah ka pe tawh a ni; Hesbon-a awm Amor-ho lal Sihona chunga i tih angin i ti tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chutichuan, amah pawh, a fapate pawh, zuah rêng rêng nei lovin a mite zawng zawng nên an that a; a ram chu an luahsak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chu an kal zêl a, Jeriko zâwn Jordan râla Moab phaiahte awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Zipora fapa Balaka chuan Israel miten Amor-ho an tih dân zawng zawng chu a hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Moab-hote chuan mite chu an hlau hle mai a, an tam si a; Israela thlahte avâng chuan Moab-hote chu an mangang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Moab-hote chuan Midian-ho upate hnênah, “Hêng mipuite hian bâwngin hlobet an pet zo angin kan vêla mi zawng zawng an pet zo dâwn e,” an ti a. Chumi lai chuan Zipora fapa Balaka chu Moab lal a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ngai teh, hnam pakhat, Aigupta ram aṭanga lo chhuakho an lo awm a; ngai teh, leilung an dâp a, min depah an awm a! Khawngaih takin lo kal la, hêng mite hi ânchhia min va lawhsak teh khai, keia tân chuan an chak lutuk a ni. Kan that theiin, kan ngam theiin, kan ram ata hi kan hnawt chhuak thei mial mahna; mal i sâwm apiangte chu malsâwmin an awm a, ânchhia i lawh apiangte chu ânchhe dawngin an awm ṭhîn tih ka hre si a,” tia ko tûrin a thlahte awmna ram Lui kama Pethor-ah Beora fapa Balaama hnênah mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Moab upate leh Midian upate chu aien man tûr kengin an chhuak ta a, Balaama hnên chu an va thleng a, Balaka thuchah chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Zânin chu hetah riak ula, Lalpan min hrilh ang angin in hnênah thu ka rawn thlen ang che u,” a ti a. Tichuan, Moab mi liante chu Balaama hnênah chuan an riak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Balaama hnênah chuan Pathian a lo kal a, “I hnêna mite hi tute nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Balaama chuan Pathian hnênah, “Zipora fapa Moab lal Balaka chuan ka hnênah, ‘Ngai teh, Aigupta ram aṭanga lo kal hnam chuan leilung an dâp a. Lo kal la, ânchhia mi va lawhsak rawh, ka do theiin ka hnawt chhuak thei mial mahna,’ tiin mi a rawn tîr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin Balaama hnênah chuan, “An hnênah i kal tûr a ni lo. Chung mite chu ânchhia i lawh tûr a ni lo, mal ka sâwmte an ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Balaama chu zîngah a tho va, Balaka mi liante hnênah chuan, “In ramah haw leh tawh u; Lalpan in hnêna kal tûra chhuah a phal lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Moab mi liante chu an tho va, Balaka hnênah an kal a, “Balaama chuan kan hnêna lo kal a duh lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Balaka chuan mi lian tam lehzual, an aia ropui zâwk a tîr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Balaama hnên an va thleng a, a hnênah, “Zipora fapa Balaka chuan heti hian a ti a ni, ‘Ka hnêna i lo kal hi eng mahin dâl teh suh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />mi ropui takah ka siam ang chia, ka hnêna i sawi apiang chu ka ti zêl ang. Chuvângin, lo kal hrâm la, hêng mite hi ânchhia mi va lawhsak teh hrâm khai,’ a ti,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Balaama chuan Balaka mite chu a chhâng a, an hnênah, “Balaka hian a in chu tangka leh rangkachaka khatin mi pe dâwn mah sela, eng khaw tê mah Lalpa ka Pathian thu bawh pêlin ka ti thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpan ka hnênah engtin nge a sawi leh dâwn teh rêng, zânin pawh hetah riak teh phawt u khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, zânah chuan Balaama hnênah Pathian chu a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Heng mite hi nangmah kova lo kal an nih chuan, tho la, an hnênah kal rawh; amaherawhchu, i hnêna ka sawi chauh hi i ti tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Balaama chu zîngah a tho va, a sabengtung a thuam a, Moab mi liante hnênah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, a kal avâng chuan Pathian thin chu a lo alh ta a; tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a lo dang tûrin kawngah a lo ding a. A sabengtung chunga chuang a ni a, a chhiahhlawhte pahnih a hnênah chuan an awm ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, sabengtung chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh, khandaih kenga kawnga ding chu a hmu a; tichuan, sabengtung chu kawng ata chu a pêng a, ram lakah a kal a. Tin, Balaama chuan sabengtung chu kawnga lêttîr tumin a vua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu grêp huan pal leh pal inkâr khuarah a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, sabengtung chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a hmu a, pal chu a va nghêng a, Balaama ke chu palah chuan a nghêng bet a; tichuan, a vaw leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu piah leh deuhvah a kal a, hmun chêp lai tak, ding lam emaw, vei lam emaw pawha pênna awm lohna lai takah a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, sabengtung chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a hmu a, Balaama chu a bawhpui ta a; tichuan, Balaama thin chu a lo alh ta a, a tiangin sabengtung chu a vua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan sabengtung chu a ṭawngtîr a, Balaama hnênah chuan, “Eng ka tih che nge, hetia vawi thum zet mi vuak tâk?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Balaaman sabengtung hnênah chuan, “Mi tihnawmnah avângin a ni. Khandaih phei chu lo keng ila, ka tihlum tawh hial ang che chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, sabengtung chuan Balaama hnênah, “Tûn thlenga i chuan fona i sabengtung ka ni lâwm ni? Hetiang hian ka ti ngai che em ni?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ti ngai lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Balaama mit chu a tihvârsak a; tichuan, Lalpa vântirhkoh, khandaih kenga kawnga ding chu a hmu ta a; a kûn a, hmaia lei siin a bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan a hnênah, “Engati nge hetia vawi thum tlawng i sabengtung i vuak? Ngai teh, ka hmaah hian i kal lohna tûra i kal avângin lo dang tûr chein ka lo chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sabengtung chuan mi hmu a, ka hmaah vawi thum a pêng a nih kha; pêng lo phei sela chu ani chu tihlum si lovin ka tihlum hial ang che chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Balaama chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh hnênah, “Ka lo sual ta a ni; mi dang tûrin kawngah i ding tih ka hre si lo va. Chuvângin, i lâwm loh chuan ka kîr leh mai ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan Balaama hnênah, “Heng mite hnênah hian kal la; amaherawhchu, i hnêna ka thusawi chauh i sawi tûr a ni,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Balaama chu Balaka mi liante hnênah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Balakan Balaama a lo kal tih a hriat chuan, Arnon lama an ramri chin Moab khawpui thlengin a va hmuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Balaka chuan Balaama hnênah, “Ṭhahnemngai taka ko tûr chein mi ka rawn tîr a ni lâwm ni? Engati nge ka hnênah i lo kal duh loh? Mi ropui takah ka siam thei lo che em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Balaama chuan Balaka hnênah, “Ngai teh, hei ka lo kal ta a; eng pawh mai sawi theihna rêng rêng ka nei em ni? Pathianin ka kâa thu a dah chauh ka sawi dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, Balaama chu Balaka hnênah chuan a kal ta a, Kiriath-huzoth an va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Balaka chu bâwng leh berâmin a inthawi a, Balaama leh a hnêna mi lian awmte chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a tûk zîngah Balaka chuan Balaama chu a hruai a, Baala hmun sângahte chuan a chhohpui a, chuta ṭang chuan mipui awmna chin zawng zawng a hmu phâk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Balaama chuan Balaka hnênah, “Hetah hian maichâm pasarih min siam la, bâwngpa pasarih leh berâmpa pasarih min buatsaihsak rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Balaka chuan Balaama sawi ang chuan a ti a; tin, Balaka leh Balaama chuan maichâm tinah chuan bâwngpa pakhat leh berâmpa pakhat an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Balaama chuan Balaka hnênah, “I hâlral thilhlan bulah hian lo ding reng la, kei chu ka han kal hrang ang a; Lalpa chu mi be tûrin a lo kal mai pawh a ni thei a, mi hrilh apiang chu ka hrilh ang che,” a ti a. Tichuan, tlâng kawlh vel vulah a han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin Balaama chu a lo tâwk a; tin, Balaama chuan a hnênah, “Maichâm pasarih chu ka siam tawh a; tin, maichâm tinah chuan bâwngpa pakhat leh berâmpa pakhat ka hlân ṭheuh va,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Balaama kâah chuan thu a dah a, “Balaka hnênah chuan kîr leh ta la, va sawi chhâwng rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, a hnên lamah chuan a lêt leh ta a; tin, ngai teh, a hâlral thilhlan bulah chuan a lo ding reng a, amah leh Moab mi lian zawng zawngte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan thu chu a sawi ta a. “Aram ata Balakan min hruai a, Chhak lam tlânga Moab lal chuan, ‘Lo kal la, Jakob-ho ânchhia min lawhsak rawh, Lo kal la, Israel-ho min demsak rawh,’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Engtin nge Pathian ânchhe lawh loh ka lawh ang? Engtin nge Pathian dem loh ka dem ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungpui chung aṭangtein anni chu ka hmu si a, Tlâng aṭangtein anni chu ka hmu a, Ngai teh, hnam hrang daih an ni, Hnam dang zînga telh loh tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakob-ho vaivut chu tu nge chhiar thei ang a, Israel-ho hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat chu tu nge chhiar thei ang? Mi fel thih angin thi ve ila, Ka tâwpna chu a tâwpna ang ni se!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Balaka chuan Balaama hnênah, “I mi tih dân hi engtizia nge ni? Ka hmêlmate ânchhe lawh tûrin ka hruai chia, hei, mal i sâwm ta hlauh zâwk si!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “ Lalpan ka kâa a dah chu ka sawi ngei tûr a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Balaka chuan a hnênah, “Hmun dangah i kal leh teh ang, chuta ṭang chuan i hmu thei hlawm ang a; an awmna chin zawng zawng i hmu ang a, an za erawh chuan i hmu vek kher lo vang; chuta ṭang chuan ânchhia min lawhsak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Zophim-ho awmna Pisga chhîpah a hruai chho va, maichâm pasarih a siam a, maichâm tinah chuan bâwngpa pakhat leh berâmpa pakhat a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Balaka hnênah chuan, “Sawlaia Lalpa ka va biak hlânin i hâlral thilhlan bulah hian lo ding reng rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Balaama chu a lo tâwk a, a kâah chuan thu a dah a, “Balaka hnênah kîr leh ta la, a hnênah va sawi chhâwng rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah chuan a va kal a, ngai teh, a hâlral thilhlan bulah chuan a lo ding reng a, Moab mi liante pawh a hnênah chuan an awm ve a. Tin, Balaka chuan a hnênah, “ Lalpan eng nge a lo sawi?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan thu chu a sawi ta a: “Tho la, Balak, ngaithla rawh; Zipora fapa, ka thu ngai rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian chu dâwt hmang mihring a ni lo va, Inlamlêt hmang hringfa a ni hek lo. A sawi tawh chu a ti lo vang em ni? A lo sawi tawh chu a tipuitling lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai teh, malsâwm tûrin thu ka hmu, Mal a sâwm tawh a, ka tidanglam thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jakob-ho khawlohna rêng a hmu lo va, Israel-hovah chhiatna rêng ka hmu hek lo. Lalpa an Pathian chuan a awmpui a, an lal atân an hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aigupta aṭangin Pathianin a hruai chhuak hlawm, Sele tha ang mai an pu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jakob-ho chungah dawi âtna a awm lo. Israel-ho chungah dawi vaihna a awm hek lo. Jakob-ho leh Israel-ho hnênah Pathian thiltih chu tihlan zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngai teh, mipuite chu sakeibaknei-pui angin an tho va, Sakeibaknei angin an zuang tho va, An sa seh an ei hma chuan an mu lâwng, An seh thisen an in hma chuan,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Balaka chuan Balaama hnênah, “Anchhia lawh hek suh la, malsâwm hek suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, Balaama chuan a chhâng a, Balaka hnênah, “ ‘ Lalpan a sawi zawng zawng chu ka ti ngei tûr a ni,’ tiin ka hrilh che a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Balaka chuan Balaama hnênah, “Hawh teh, hmun dangah ka hruai teh ang che; chuta ṭang chuan ânchhia min lawhsak Pathianin a remti mial dah law maw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, Balaka chuan Balaama chu thlalêr zuk chhuk en Peor chhîpah a hruai chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Balaaman Balaka hnênah chuan, “Hetah hian maichâm pasarih min siamsak la, bâwngpa pasarih leh berâmpa pasarih min buatsaihsak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Balaka chuan Balaama sawi ang chuan a ti a, maichâm tinah chuan bâwngpa pakhat leh berâmpa pakhat a hlân a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel-ho malsâwmsak chu Lalpa duh zâwng a ni tih Balaaman a hriatin, ni danga a tih ang khân dawi âtna lam ti tûra kal lovin thlalêr lam a pan ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Balaama chu a vanvadâk a, Israel mite chu an hnam dân zir zêla awm a hmu a; tin, Pathian thlarau a chungah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, thu chu a sawi ta a: “Beora fapa Balaama, Mit vâra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian thûte hriaa, Engkimtitheia inlârna hmua, Tlu bawkkhupa mit lo vâr ta chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Aw Jakob-ho, in puan inte chu a va ṭha êm! Aw Israel-ho, in biak bûkte chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ruam angin a pharh duai a, Lui kama huan ang, Lalpa phun sasua ang, Lui kama sidar thingte ang an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ruahtui tam tak a dawng ang a, Tui tamna hmunah thlai chîte a chîng ang. A lal chu Agaga aiin a ropui ang a; A ram chu chawimawiin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta ata Pathianin a hruai chhuak a, Sele tha ang mai an pu a, An hmêlma, hnam dangte chu an ei zo vang a, An thalin an kâp tlang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An kûn a, sakeibaknei angin an bawk a, Sakeibakneipui ang maiin; tu nge titho ngam ang? Malsâwmtu apiang che u chu malsâwmin awm sela, Anchhe lawhtu apiang che u chu ânchhe lawhin awm rawh se,’ a ti,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Balaama chungah chuan Balaka thin chu a alh a; Balaka chuan Balaama hnênah, “Ka hmêlmate ânchhe lawh tûrin ka ko chia, hei, vawi thum zet mal i sâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, i awmnaah kal bo daih rawh; ropui taka chawisân che ka rilrûk a ni a; nimahsela, ngai teh, Lalpan chawisân che a dâl ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Balaama chuan Balaka hnênah, “Balaka hian a in chu tangkarua leh rangkachaka khatin min pe dâwn mah sela, a ṭha lam emaw, a chhe lam emaw, keima rilru puakchhuak chuan Lalpa thu piah lam chu eng mah ka ti thei lo; ‘ Lalpan a sawi apiang chu ka sawi ang,’ tiin i mi tirhte hnênah pawh ka sawi rêng a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka mite hnênah ka kal tawh ang a, hawh teh, hêng mite hian tûn hnua i mite chunga an tih dân tûr ka hrilh teh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan thu chu a sawi ta a: “Beora fapa Balaama, Mit vâra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian thûte hriaa, Chungnungbera hriatna hriaa, Engkimtitheia inlârna hmua, Tlu bawkkhupa mit lo vâr ta chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nakin hnua a awm dân tûr ka hmu a, Tûn mai piah lam ka hmuhsak a: ‘Jakoba aṭangin arsi a lo chhuak ang a, Israela aṭangin lal tiang a lo chhuak ang a, Moab ram tluanin a chhun tlang ang a, Setha thlahte a titlâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hmêlma ṭhîn Edom leh Seir-te chu a chang ang, Israel-te chan a ṭhat chhûng zawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakoba aṭangin tu emaw a lal ang a, Khuaa la awm chhunte chu a tiboral ang,’ a ti,” a ti a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Amalek lam a hawi a, thu chu a sawi a, “Amalek chu hnam bul ber a ni na a, A lêr lam chu boralna a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Ken lam a hawi a, thu chu a sawi a, “I awmna hmun chu a nghet a, I bu chu lungpuia chheh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mahse, Ken chu a ṭiau vang a, Assur-hovin sala an hruai bo che thlengin,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, thu chu a sawi leh a, “Pathianin hetianga a tihin tu nge nung thei ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mahse, Kittim ram aṭangin lawngte a lo thleng ang a, Assur an tihrehawm ang a, Eber an tihrehawm ang a, Ani pawh a boral ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Balaama chu a tho va, a khaw lamah a haw ta a; Balaka pawh chu a haw ve ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel-ho chu Sitim-ah an awm a; tin, Moab-ho fanute chu an pâwl ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An pathiante hnêna an inthawinaahte chuan an sâwm a; tichuan, an ei a, an pathiante chu chibai an bûk ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Israel-ho chuan Peor hmuna Baala chu an pawm ve ta a; tichuan, Israel-ho chungah Lalpa thin chu a alh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Mipuite hotu zawng zawng chu hruai la, Lalpa thinurna ṭihbaiawm tak mai chu Israel-ho chung ata a kian theih nân, chhûn êngah Lalpa hmaah khai hlum rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Israel-ho rorêltute hnênah chuan, “Peor hmuna Baala pawm apiangte chu tihlum vek rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Israela thlahte zinga mi pakhatin inbiakna puan in kawngkaa an ṭah lai takin, Mosia mit hmuhah leh Israel-ho pung khâwmte mit hmuhah, Midian hmeichhe pakhat a chhûngte hnênah a rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Arona fa Eleazara fapa Phinehasan a han hmuh chuan pung khâwmho zîng ata chu a tho va, fei a chuh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tin, Israel mi chu puan in chhûngah chuan a ûm lût a, Israel mi nên an pahnih chuan a chhun tlang a, hmeichhia chu a pumah. Chutichuan, Israela thlahte chunga hremna chu a reh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi hremnaa thite chu sînghnih leh sângli an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Puithiam Arona fa Eleazara fapa Phinehasa hian ka thîk anga an zînga a thîkna chuan ka thinurna chu Israela thlahte lak ata a tikiang ta a; tichuan, ka thîkna chuan Israela thlahte chu ka tiboral lo vang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, ‘Ngai teh, ka inremna thuthlung chu a chungah ka thlung ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, amah leh a hnua a thlahte tân kumkhaw puithiam nihna thuthlung a ni ang a; a Pathian tân a thîka, Israela thlahte tân inremna a siam avângin,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel mi an thah, Midian hmeichhia nêna an thah tâka hming chu Zimria, Simeon-ho zînga an chhûngkaw puipa Salua fapa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Midian hmeichhia an thah tâka hming chu Kozbi, Zura fanu a ni; ani chu Midian-ho chhûngkaw zînga an hotu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Midian-ho chu bei ula, titlâwm rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Peor hmunah an bum che u a, hrem tâk Midian-ho mi lian fanu, Kozbi an thah tâk chungchâng thûah in chungah thil dik lo tak an tih avâng hian,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, hremna a reh hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, Lalpan Mosia leh puithiam Arona fapa Eleazara chu a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte pung khâwmho zawng zawng chu, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam, a chi chiin Israel rama râlkai chin zawng zawng chhiar vek rawh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia leh puithiam Eleazara chuan Jeriko zâwn, Jordan kam, Moab phaiah anniho chu an bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mipuite chu kum sawmhnih achin chung lam chhiar rawh u,” tiin, Lalpan Mosia leh Aigupta ram aṭanga lo chhuak Israela thlahte hnêna thu a pêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israela fa tîr chu Reubena a ni a. Reubena fapate: Hanok-ho chhûngkaw zînga mi Hanoka; Palu-ho chhûngkaw zînga mi Palua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hezron-ho chhûngkaw zînga mi Hezrona; Karmi-ho chhûngkaw puipa Karmia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hêngho hi Reuben-ho chhûngkua an ni: chhiar tling zawng zawngte chu 43,730 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Palua thlah, Eliaba.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Eliaba thlahte: Nemuela, Dathana, Abirama an ni. Hêng Dathana te leh Abirama te hi an ni, Lalpa an beih laia Mosia leh Arona beitu Kora pâwla tel pung khâwmho thlahte chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tin, chumi pâwl an thih lai chuan leiin a kâ a âng a, Kora te nên chuan a lem tlâng a, meiin mi zahnih leh sawmnga a lem ṭum khân; tichuan, chhinchhiahna an lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Kora fapate chu an thi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A chhûngkua kuain Simeona thlahte: Nemuela thlahte Nemuel-ho, Jamina thlahte Jamin-ho; Jakina thlahte Jakin-ho;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zera thlahte Zera-ho; Saula thlahte Saul-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêngho hi Simeona thlahte chu an ni a, 22,200 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A chhûngkua kuain Gada fapate: Zephona thlahte Zephon-ho; Hagia thlahte Hagi-ho; Sunia thlahte Suni-ho;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Oznia thlahte Ozni-ho; Eria thlahte Eri-ho;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aroda thlahte Arod-ho; Arelia thlahte Areli-ho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hêngho hi an chhiar dân anga Gada fapate thlahte chu an ni a, 40,500 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Juda fapate, Era leh Onana: Era leh Onana chu Kanaan ramah an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Juda thlahte chhûngkaw kal dân chu hetiang hi a ni: Sela thlahte Sela-ho; Pereza thlahte Perez-ho; Zera thlahte Zera-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Pereza thlahte chu: Hezrona thlahte Hezron-ho; Hamula thlahte Hamul-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêngho hi an chhiar dân anga Juda fapate thlahte chu an ni a, 76,500 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A chhûngkua kuain Isakara thlahte: Tola thlahte Tola-ho; Pua thlahte Pu-ho;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jasuba thlahte Jasub-ho; Simrona thlahte Simron-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hêng hi an chhiar dân anga Isakara fapate thlahte an ni a, 64,300 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A chhûngkua kuain Zebuluna thlahte: Sereda thlahte Sered-ho; Elona thlahte Elon-ho; Jahleela thlahte Jaleel-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hêng hi an chhiar dân anga Zebulun-ho thlahte chu an ni a, 60,500 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A chhûngkua kuain Josefa thlahte: Manasea leh Ephraima.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Manasea thlahte: Makira thlahte Makir-ho; tin, Makiran Gileada a hring a; Gileada thlahte Gilead-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hêng hi Gileada thlahte an ni: Iezera thlahte Iezer-ho; Heleka thlahte Helek-ho;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asriela thlahte Asriel-ho; Sekema thlahte Sekem-ho;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Semida thlahte Semida-ho; Hephera thlahte Hepher-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Hephera fapa Zelophehada chuan fapate nei lovin fanute a nei a: Zelophehada fanute hming chu Malai te, Novai te, Hoglai te, Milkai te, Tirzai te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hêngte hi Manasea thlahte an ni. An chhiar zawngte chu 52,700 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hêng hi a chhûngkua kuain Ephraima thlahte an ni: Suthela thlahte Suthel-ho; Bekera thlahte Beker-ho; Tahana thlahte Tahan-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, hêng hi Suthela thlahte an ni: Erana thlahte Eran-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hêng hi an chhiar dân anga Ephraima thlahte chhûngkua an ni a, 32,500 an ni. Hêng hi an chhûngkaw indawt dân ang zêla Josefa thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A chhûngkua kuain Benjamina thlahte: Bela thlahte Bela-ho; Asbela thlahte Asbel-ho; Ahirama thlahte Ahiram-ho;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Suphama thlahte Supham-ho; Huphama thlahte Hupham-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Bela thlahte chu Arda leh Naamana an ni: Arda thlahte Ard-ho; Naamana thlahte Naaman-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hêng hi an chhûngkaw indawt dân ang zêla Benjamina thlahte an ni; tin, an chhiar zawngte chu 45,600 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hêng hi a chhûngkua kuain Dana thlahte an ni: Suhama thlahte Suham-ho an ni. Hêng hi an chhûngkaw indawt dân ang zêla Dana thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Suham-ho thlahte zawng zawng an chhiar dân ang chuan 64,400 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hêng hi a chhûngkua kuain Asera thlahte: Imna thlahte Imna-ho; Isvia thlahte Isvi-ho; Beria thlahte Beria-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Beria thlahte: Hebera thlahte Heber-ho; Malkiela thlahte Malkiel-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Asera fanu hming chu Seri a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hêng hi Asera fapate thlahte an chhiar zawngte chu an ni a, 53,400 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A chhûngkua kuain Naphtalia thlahte: Jazeela thlahte Jazeel-ho; Gunia thlahte Guni-ho;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jezera thlahte Jezer-ho; Silema thlahte Silem-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Heng hi an chhûngkaw indawt dân ang zêla Naphtalia thlahte an ni; an chhiar zawngte chu 45,400 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Hêng hi Israela thlah an chhiar zawngte chu an ni a, 6,01,730 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />“Hêngho hi an tam lam ang zêlin ram hi semsak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />A tam deuhte chu ram i pe tam ang a, a tlêm deuhte chu ram i pe tlêm ang a; chhiar dân ang chuan ram pêk ṭheuh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ṭhumvâwrin ram chu sem tûr a ni; an pute hnam hming indawt dân ang zêlin ram chu an chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ṭhumvâwr ang zêlin ram chu a tam leh a tlêmte hnênah sem a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tin, hêng hi Levi-ho chhûngkua kuaa chhiarte chu an ni: Gersona thlahte Gerson-ho; Kohatha thlahte Kohath-ho; Meraria thlahte Merari-ho an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hêngho hi Levia thlahte an ni: Libna thlahte, Hebrona thlahte, Mahlia thlahte, Musia thlahte, Kora thlahte an ni. Tin, Kohatha chuan Amrama a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tin, Amrama nupui hming chu Jokebedi, Levia fanu, Aigupta rama Levia laka piang a ni a; tin, ani chuan Amrama lakah Arona leh Mosia leh an farnu Miriami a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tin, Arona chuan Nadaba te, Abihua te, Eleazera te, Ithamara te a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tin, Nadaba leh Abihua chu Lalpa hmaa hman loh tûr chi mei an hman lai khân an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tin, chhiar zawng zawng mipa thla khat achin chung lam zawng zawngte chu 23,000 an ni. Israel mite zîngah ram sem chang ve tûr an nih loh avângin Israel mite zîngah chhiar an ni lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Hêngte hi a ni Jeriko zâwn, Jordan kam, Moab phaia Israela thlahte chhiartu Mosia leh puithiam Eleazaran an chhiarte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Sinai thlalêra Israel mite Mosia leh puithiam Aronan an chhiarte kha pakhat mah awm an awm tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Lalpan , “Thlalêrah an thi ngei ngei tûr a ni,” a lo ti tawh si a. Jephunea fapa Kaleba leh Nuna fapa Josua lo chu tu mah dam an awm tawh lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Josefa fapa Manasea thlah, Manasea fa Makira, chu mi fa Gileada, chu mi fa Hephera fapa Zelophehada fanute chu an lo kal a; a fanute hming chu: Malai te, Novai te, Hoglai te, Milkai te, Tirzai te a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, inbiakna puan in kawngkaah Mosia leh puithiam Eleazara leh mi lianho leh pung khâwmho zawng zawng hmaah chuan an va ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Thlalêrah khân kan pa a thi a, Lalpa bei tûra pung khâwm pâwl, Kora pâwlah khân a tel ve lo ve; nimahsela, ama sual avângin a thi a, fapa a nei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Fapa a neih loh avâng maiin engah nge kan pa hming chu a thlahte zîng ata a bo vang? Kan pa unaute zîngah chanvo min pe ve rawh u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Mosian an thu chu Lalpa hmaah a thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Zelophehada fanute chuan an tidik a ni; an pa unaute zîngah chanvo i siam ngei tûr a ni a, an pa chanvo chu i pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte hnênah, ‘Mi, fapa nei lova a thih chuan a ro chu a fanute in pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, fanu a neih loh chuan a ro chu a unaute in pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, unaute a neih loh chuan a ro chu a pa unaute in pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, a pain unaute a neih loh chuan a ro chu a laichîn in pe ang a, anin a khâwm ang. Tin, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk angin Israela thlahte tân dân thupêk nghet a ni ang,’ tiin sawi rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Abarim tlângah khian han chho la, Israela thlahte ka pêk tûr ram han thlîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, i han hmuh zawh chuan i unaupa Arona chu a chipuite hnênah hruai a ni ang bawkin nang pawh hruai i ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zin thlalêra pung khâwmho an phunnawi laia an mit hmuhah tuiah khân, mi chawimawi tûra ka thupêk che kalha i hel avâng khân,” a ti a (Chûng chu Zin thlalêra Kadesh-a Meriba tuite chu a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Lalpa a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Lalpa , nunna zawng zawng hnâr Pathian chuan, Lalpa mi pung khâwmte chu vêngtu nei lo berâm anga an awm loh nân pung khâwm chunga hotu, an hma hruaia, anmahni hruai chhuaka hruai lûttu tûr ruat rawh se,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Nuna fapa, mi rilru nei tak Josua chu hruai la, a chungah i kut nghat la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />puithiam Eleazara leh pung khâwmho hmaah dintîr la, an mit hmuhah thuneihna pe rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlah pung khâwmho zawng zawngin a thu an âwih theih nân thuneihna hlân rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu puithiam Eleazara hmaah a ding ang a, anin Lalpa hmaah Urim hmangin thu a la ang a; a thûin an chhuak ang a, a thûin an lût ang, amah leh Israela thlah zawng zawngte, pung khâwmho zawng zawngte nên,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Lalpa thupêk ang chuan a ti a. Josua chu a hruai a, Eleazara leh pung khâwmho zawng zawng hmaah chuan a dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, a chungah a kut a nghat a, Mosia hmanga Lalpan a sawi ang khân thuneihna a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte chu thu pe la, an hnênah, ‘Ka chaw, ka tâna rimtui meia thilhlan, ka hnêna thilhlan chu a hun tak zêl ṭheuhvah in hlan tûr a ni,’ ti la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, ‘Hei hi meia thilhlan Lalpa hnêna in hlan tûr chu a ni: berâmno a pa, kum khat mi, sawisêl bo, ni tin pahnih, hâlral thilhlan hlan reng atân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Berâmno pakhat chu zîngah in hlân ang a, pakhat chu tlai lamah in hlân ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />chhangphut thilhlan atân chhangphut dip mi epha hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat, hriak sâwr hin hmun lia ṭhena hmun khata chawhpawlh nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa tâna meia thilhlan, rimtui atâna Sinai tlânga ruat hâlral thilhlan hlan reng tûra kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, berâmno pakhat hlannaa in tûr thilhlan chu, hin hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat a ni tûr a ni; Lalpa tâna uain, in tûr thilhlan chu hmun thianghlimah i bun chhuak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, berâmno pakhat chu tlai lamah i hlân tûr a ni; zîng lama chhangphut thilhlan ang leh chumia in tûr thilhlan ang bawk chu, Lalpa tâna rimtui atân meia thilhlan chu i hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Chawlhniah berâmno, a pa kum khat mi sawisêl bo pahnih leh, chhangphut thilhlan atân chhangphut dip mi, epha hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun hnih hriaka chawhpawlh leh, chumia in tûr thilhlan nên i hlân tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hei hi Chawlhni apianga hâlral thilhlan reng leh, chumia in tûr thilhlan tiam lova hâlral thilhlan hlan tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, in thla thar apiangah Lalpa tân hâlral thilhlan in hlân tûr a ni: bâwngpatuai pahnih leh berâmpa pakhat leh berâmno a pa kum khat mi sawisêl bo pasarih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tin, bâwngpa tinah chhangphut thilhlan atân chhangphut dip mi, hriaka chawhpawlh epha hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun thum; tin, berâm pakhatah chhangphut thilhlanah chhangphut dip mi hriaka chawhpawlh hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun hnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, berâmno tinah chhangphut thilhlanah chhangphut dip mi, hriaka chawhpawlh hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat; hei hi hâlral thilhlan rimtui Lalpa tân meia thilhlan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, an in tûr thilhlan chu bâwngpa pakhatah uain hin chanve a ni ang a, berâmpa pakhatah hin hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat, berâmno pakhatah hin hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat; hei hi kum tluana thla tin hâlral thilhlan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa hnêna sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat in hlân tûr a ni; hâlral thilhlan hlan reng leh chumia in tûr thilhlan tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, thla khatna, ni sâwm leh ni li ni chu Lalpa Kalhlên Kût a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chumi thla ni sâwm leh ni nga ni chu ruai ni a ni ang; ni sarih chu chhang dawidim telh loh ei tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni khat ni chuan inkhâwmpui thianghlim a awm ang a; eng hna mah in thawk tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Meia thilhlan hâlral thilhlan erawh chu Lalpa hnênah in hlân tûr a ni: bâwngpatuai pahnih leh berâmpa pakhat leh berâmno a pa kum khat mi pasarih; in ngaiha sawisêl bo a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chhangphut dip mi, hriaka chawhpawlh, an chhangphut thilhlan nên: bâwngpa pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun thum, berâmpa pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun hnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />berâmno pasarih chu beramno pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat a ni tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tin, in tâna inremna siamna tûrin sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hêng hi zînga thilhlan, hâlral thilhlan hlan reng tiam lovin in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hetiang hian Lalpa tâna rimtui, meia thilhlan ei tûr chu ni tin, ni sarih in hlân tûr a ni; hâlral thilhlan hlan reng leh chumia in tûr thilhlan tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a ni sarih ni chuan inkhâwmpui thianghlim in nei ang a, eng hna mah in thawk tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, in chawlhkâr kût, in buh thar tirh kût Lalpa tâna thil thar chhangphut thilhlan in hlan ni pawhin, inkhâwmpui thianghlim in nei ang a; eng hna mah in thawk tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa tâna rimtui hâlral thilhlan erawh chu in hlân tûr a ni: bâwngpatuai pahnih, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pasarih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />an chhangphut thilhlan, chhangphut dip mi hriaka chawhpawlh nên: bâwngpa pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun thum, berâmpa pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun hnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />berâmno pasarih, berâmno pakhat ṭheuhvah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />in tana inremna siam nân kêlpa pakhat nên (in ngaiha sawisêl bo a ni tûr a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hâlral thilhlan hlan reng leh, chumia chhangphut thilhlan leh in tûr thilhlan tiam lovin in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, thla sarihna, a ni khat ni chuan inkhâwmpui thianghlim in nei ang a; eng hna mah in thawk tûr a ni lo. In tân tawtawrâwt ham ni a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa tâna rimtuiah hâlral thilhlan in hlân ang a; bâwngpatuai pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi sawisêl bo pasarih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An chhangphut thilhlan, chhangphut dip mi hriaka chawhpawlh, bâwngpa pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun thum, berâmpa pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun hnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />berâmno pasarih, pakhat ṭheuhvah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />in tâna inremna siam nân sual thawina kêlpa pakhat nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thla thar hâlral thilhlan leh chumia chhangphut thilhlan te, hâlral thilhlan hlan reng leh chumia chhangphut thilhlan te, in tûr thilhlan te, an tih dân pângngai Lalpa tâna rimtuia meia thilhlante tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, he thla sarihna, ni sâwm ni hian inkhâwmpui thianghlim in nei ang a. Chaw in nghei tûr a ni a, eng hna mah in thawk tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa tâna rimtuiah hâlral thilhlan erawh chu in hlân tûr a ni: bâwngpa pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi pasarih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />in ngaiha sawisêl bo a ni tûr a ni. An chhangphut thilhlan, chhangphut dip mi hriaka chawhpawlh, bâwngpa pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun thum, berâmpa pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun hnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />berâmno pasarih, berâmno pakhat ṭheuhvah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat nên; inremna tûra sual thawina te, hâlral thilhlan hlan reng te, chumia chhangphut leh an in tûr thilhlante tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, thla sarihna, ni sâwm leh ni nga nîah inkhâwmpui thianghlim in nei ang a; eng hna mah in thawk lo vang a, Lalpa tân ni sarih in kût tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa tâna rimtuiah meia thilhlan, hâlral thilhlan in hlân tûr a ni: bâwngpatuai sâwm leh pathum, berâmpa pahnih, berâmno a pa kum khat mi sâwm leh pali; sawisêl bo ṭheuh a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An chhangphut thilhlan, chhangphut dip mi hriaka chawhpawlh, bâwngpa sâwm leh pathum, bâwngpa pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun thum, berâmpa pahnih, berâmpa pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun hnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />berâmno sâwm leh pali, berâmno pakhatah hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat nên; hâlral thilhlan hlan reng, chumia chhangphut thilhlan te, in tûr thilhlante tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a ni hnih nîah bâwngpatuai sâwm leh pahnih, berâmpa pahnih, berâmno a pa kum khat mi, sawisêl bo, sâwm leh pali in hlân tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />an chhangphut thilhlan leh in tûr thilhlan a dân ang takin an tam dân ang zêlin bâwngpa tân te, berâmpa tân te, berâmno tân te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat nên; hâlral thilhlan hlan reng te, chumia chhangphut thilhlan te, in tûr thilhlante tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a ni thum ni chuan bâwngpa sâwm leh pakhat, berâmpa pahnih, berâmno a pa kum khat mi sawisêl bo sâwm leh pali;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />an chhangphut thilhlan leh in tûr thilhlan a dân ang takin an tam dân ang zêlin bâwngpa tân te, berâmpa tân te, berâmno tân te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat nên; hâlral thilhlan hlan reng leh chumia in tûr thilhlan tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, a ni li ni chuan bâwngpa sâwm, berâmpa pahnih, berâmno a pa kum khat mi sawisêl bo sâwm leh pali;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />an chhangphut thilhlan leh in tûr thilhlan, a dân ang takin an tam dân ang zêlin bâwngpa tân te, berâmpa tân te, berâmno tân te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat nên; hâlral thilhlan hlan reng te, chumia chhangphut thilhlan leh in tûr thilhlante tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, a ni nga ni chuan bâwngpa pakua, berâmpa pahnih, berâmno a pa kum khat mi sawisêl bo sâwm leh pali;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />an chhangphut thilhlan leh in tûr thilhlan, a dân ang takin an tam dân ang zêlin bâwngpa tân te, berâmpa tân te, berâmno tân te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat nên; hâlral thilhlan hlan reng te, chumia chhangphut thilhlan leh chumia in tûr thilhlante tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, a ni ruk ni chuan bâwngpa pariat, berâmpa pahnih, berâmno a pa kum khat mi sawisêl bo sâwm leh pali;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />an chhangphut thilhlan leh in tûr thilhlan, a dân ang takin an tam dân ang zêlin bâwngpa tân te, berâmpa tân te, berâmno tân te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat nên; hâlral thilhlan hlan reng te, chumia chhangphut thilhlan leh chumia in tûr thilhlante tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, a ni sarih ni chuan bâwngpa pasarih, berâmpa pahnih, berâmno a pa kum khat mi sawisêl bo sâwm leh pali;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />an chhangphut thilhlan leh in tûr thilhlan, a dân ang takin an tam dân ang zêlin bâwngpa tân te, berâmpa tân te, berâmno tân te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat nên; hâlral thilhlan hlan reng te, chumia chhangphut thilhlan leh chumia in tûr thilhlante tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, a ni riat ni chuan inkhâwmpui ropui tak in nei ang a, eng hna mah in thawk tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa tâna rimtuiah meia thilhlan hâlral thilhlan erawh chu in hlân tûr a ni: bâwngpa pakhat, berâmpa pakhat, berâmno a pa kum khat mi sawisêl bo pasarih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />an chhangphut thilhlan leh an in tûr thilhlan, bâwngpa tân te, berâmpa tân te, berâmno tân te, a dân ang takin an tam dân ang zêlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />sual thawi nân kêlpa pakhat nên; hâlral thilhlan hlan reng leh chumia chhangphut thilhlan leh chumia in tûr thilhlan tiam lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />In thutiam te, in duh thûa thilhlan te, in hâlral thilhlan te, in chhangphut thilhlan te, in in tûr thilhlan te, in remna thilhlan te tiam lovin hêng hi in hunbi nei kût niin Lalpa hnênah in hlân tûr a ni,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk zawng zawng chu Israela thlahte chu Mosia chuan a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Israela thlahte hnamho puipate chu a bia a, “Hei hi a ni, Lalpan thu a pêk chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />miin Lalpa hnêna thu a tiam emaw, chhechhama mahni intiamkamna emaw a neih chuan a hlen ngei tûr a ni; a thu ang zawng zawng chu a ti vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pate ina awm lai nula pawhin Lalpa hnêna thu a tiam emaw, chhechhama intiamkamna emaw a neih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a pain a thutiam emaw, a intiamkamna emaw chu a hriata, a ngawihsan mai chuan a thutiam emaw, a intiamkamna emaw chu a ti ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A pain a hriat nî ngeia a phal loh erawh chuan a thutiam emaw, a intiamkamna emaw ata chu a fihlîm ang a, a pain a phal loh avângin Lalpan ani chu a ngaidam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngaihtuah thui mang lova thutiam emaw, intiamkamna emaw nei laiin pasal a neiha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a pasalin a hriat nîa a ngawihsan mai chuan a thutiam emaw, a intiamkamna emaw chu a hlen ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, a pasalin a hriat nîa a phal loh chuan ngaihtuah thui lo va thu a lo intiamkamna emaw ata chu a fihlîm ang; tin, Lalpan a ngaidam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmeithai te, mâkchhiat tâwk te erawh chuan an thutiam emaw, an intiamkamna emaw chu an hlen ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasalte ina awm laia thutiam emaw, intiamkamna emaw chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a pasalin a hriat pawha a ngawihsana, a hnial loh chuan a thu intiamkamna chu a hlen tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, a pasalin a hriat nîa a ṭhiat emaw, a tihbosak emaw chuan a thutiam leh a intiamkamna chu sût a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thutiam emaw, intiamkamna emaw rêng rêng a pasalin a remtihpuiin a ṭhiatsak thei bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, a pasalin a hriata a ngawihsan mai chuan, a thutiam ang leh a intiamkamna ang ngei chuan a ti tûr a ni; a hriat nî aṭanga a ngawihsan avângin a nemnghehpui tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hriat veleh a ṭhiata, a tihbosak erawh chuan a mawh chu aman a phur tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hêng hi, mipa leh a nupui kâr leh, pa leh a fanu nulât laia a pa ina la awm reng an kâra dân tûra Lalpan Mosia thu a pêkte chu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Midian-ho chungah Israela thlahte phuba la rawh. Chumi zawhah chuan i chipuite hnênah hruai i ni tawh ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chuan mipuite chu a bia a, “Midian-ho chunga Lalpa phuba lâkna hlen tûra Midian-ho beia indo tûrin in zînga mi inrâlthuam rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel hnam zawng zawng zînga hnam tina mi sângkhat zêl indonaah in kaltîr tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel-ho sâng tam tak zîng ata, hnam tin aṭangin 1,000 ṭheuh, indonaa kal tûrin sipai 12,000 an theh chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian chi tin zînga mi 1,000 ṭheuh leh puithiam Eleazara fapa Phinehasa, hmun thianghlima bungbêlte, thupêk vêl nâna tawtawrâwtte kengin indonaah a kaltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk angin Midian-ho an do va; mipa zawng zawng an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An mi thahte zîngah chuan Midian-ho lalte pawh an tel a; Midian-ho lal panga - Evia te, Rekema te, Zura te, Hura te, Reba te chu; Beora fapa Balaama pawh khandaihin an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Midian-ho nunaute salah an hruai a; tin, an ran zawng zawngte, an berâm rual zawng zawngte, an bungrua zawng zawngte chu râllâk sum atân an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An awmna khua zawng zawngte, an riahhmun zawng zawngte an hâl vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, mihring leh ran, sal leh râllâk sum zawng zawng an kalpui vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, sal te, man te, râllâk sumte chu Mosia leh puithiam Eleazara leh Israela thlah pung khâwmho hnênah, Jeriko zâwn Jordan kam Moab phaia an riahhmunah chuan an rawn thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh puithiam Eleazara leh pung khâwmho puipa zawng zawngte chuan daiah an lo va hmuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chu sipai hotu, sâng chunga hotute leh za chunga hotu te, indona aṭanga lo hawte chungah chuan a thinur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosian an hnênah, “Hmeichhia chu damin in la zuah vek maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Balaama remruat chuan Peor chungchâng thûah, Israela thlahte chu Lalpa chunga bawhchhiatna tithlengtute chu hêng hi an ni, Lalpa mi pung khâwmho zîngah chuan hri a lo lên tâk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, naupang zînga mipa zawng zawng chu that ula, hmeichhia mi pâwl tawh zawng zawng that bawk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmeichhe naupang, mi pâwl loh zawng zawng erawh chu in tân zuah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, daiah ni sarih riak ula; tu pawh mi that leh mitthi khawih apiangte chu ni thum ni leh ni sarih nîah inthian rawh u, nangmahni leh in salte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, thuamhnaw rêng rêng leh savuna thilsiam zawng zawng te, kêl hmula thilsiam zawng zawng te, thinga thilsiam zawng zawng thûah chuan in inthian tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Eleazara chuan indonaa kal indo mite hnênah chuan, “Hei hi Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk dân thuruat chu a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />eng pawh ni sela, rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te, thîr te, rângva te, suan te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />eng pawh meia hâla chhe thei lo apiangte chu meiah in thawlh tlang ang a; tichuan, a lo thianghlim ang; eng pawh ni sela, tlen faina tuiin tihthianghlim tûr a ni. Amaherawhchu, meia hâl tuar thei lo apiang chu tuiah in thawlh tlang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a ni sarih nîah in puan in su ang a, in lo thianghlim ang a, chumi zawhah chuan riahhmunah in lo lût dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nang nên, puithiam Eleazara nên, pung khâwmho chhûngkaw puipate nên râllâk suma an lâk mihring leh rante chu chhiar vek ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tin, râllâk sum chu hmun hnihah ṭhen ula, indonaa kal indo mite tân leh punghote tân;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tin, indonaa kalho chan aṭang chuan mihring te, bâwng te, sabengtung te, berâm te, thil nung zawng zawng zanga zêlah pakhat, Lalpa hnênah chhiah pêk tûr tihhransak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chûng chu la ula, Lalpa tâna thên thilhlanah puithiam Eleazara pe rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, a chanve Israela thlahte pual chu sawmnga ata pakhat tîl hrang zêl la, mihring aṭang te, bâwng aṭang te, sabengtung aṭang te, berâm rual aṭang te, ran rual aṭang tein; tin, chûng chu Lalpa biak bûk enkawltu Levi-hote pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang chuan Mosia leh puithiam Eleazara chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sipaiten an man râllâk sum tiam lovin an lâk chu berâm 6,75,000,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />bâwng 72,000,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />sabengtung 61,000,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />mihring chu hmeichhia, mipa la pâwl ngai loh 32,000 an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, a chanve, indonaa kalte chanvo chu, berâm 3,37,500 a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />tin, Lalpa chhiah berâm chu 675.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, bâwng chu 36,000 a ni a, chumia Lalpa chhiah chu 72 a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, sabengtung chu 30,500 a ni a, chumia Lalpa chhiah chu 61 a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, mihring chu 16,000 an ni a, chumia Lalpa chhiah chu mi 32 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk angin chhiah, Lalpa thên thilhlan chu Mosian puithiam Eleazara a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Mosian râl kâp mite an chanvo a pêk zawha Israel-ho chanvo chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />berâm 3,37,500,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />bâwng 36,000,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />sabengtung 30,500, mihring 16,000,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Israel-hovin an chan aṭang chuan Mosia chuan mihring leh ran sawmnga zêlah pakhat a la a, Lalpa thupêk angin Lalpa biak bûk enkawltu Levi-ho a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, sipaite chunga hotu te, za chunga hotu te chuan Mosia an va hnaih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mosia hnênah, “I chhiahhlawhte hian kan kuta awm indo mite chu kan chhiar a, tu mah kim lo kan awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, kan nunna atân Lalpa hmaa inremna siamna tûrin Lalpa tâna thilhlan miin an neih zâwng, rangkachaka siam cheimawi thuam - kebun te, bânbun te, hming nemna zungbun te, bengbeh te, ṭhî te kan rawn la e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh puithiam Eleazara chuan rangkachaka siam an thuam zawng zawng chu an lo la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Sâng chunga hotu leh za chunga hotute rangkachak, Lalpa hnêna thên thilhlana an hlan zawng zawng chu sekel 16,750 a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />(Râl kâp mite chuan râllâk sum chu mahni tân ṭheuhva la an ni a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh puithiam Eleazara chuan sâng chunga hotu leh za chunga hotute rangkachak chu an la a, Israela thlahte hriat rengna atân inbiakna puan inah Lalpa hmaah an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Reubena leh Gada thlahte chuan ran an ngah hle mai a; tin, Jazer ram leh Gilead ram an hmuh chuan a hmun chu ran tâna hmun ṭha tak niin an hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tichuan, Gada thlahte leh Reubena thlahte chuan Mosia leh puithiam Eleazara leh pung khâwmho puipate chu an va bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Israel pung khâwmho hmaa Lalpan a tihtlâwm ram Atarot te, Dibon te, Jazer te, Nimra te, Hesbon te, Eleale te, Sebam te, Nebo te, Beon te chu ran tâna ṭha tak ram a ni a; tin, i chhiahhlawhte hian ran kan nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rem i tih zâwng a nih chuan he ram hi kan luah atân min pe la, Jordan lui min hruai kai lo mai rawh khai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Gada thlahte leh Reubena thlahte hnênah chuan, “In unaute chu indonaah an kal ang a, nangni chu hetah hian in lo awm mai ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Engati nge Lalpan a pêk rama lût lo tûra Israela thlahte rilru in tihzâm dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kadesh-barnea aṭanga ram va thlithlai tûra ka tirh khân hetiang bawk hian in pute chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eskol ruam an han thlen chhoh khân ram chu an han hmu a, Lalpan ram a pêkah chuan an luh lohna tûrin Israel thlahte rilru an tihzâmsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi ni chuan Lalpa chu a thinur ta êm êm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Aigupta ram ata lo chhuak, kum sawmhnih achin chung lam mi rêng rêng chuan Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te hnêna chhechhama ka pêk ram chu tu mân an hmu lo vang, min zui tak tak loh avângin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keniz mi Jephunea fapa Kaleba leh Nuna fapa Josua-te chauh lo chuan; anni chuan Lalpa chu an zui tak tak avângin,’ tiin chhia a chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Israel-hote chungah Lalpa thin chu a alh a, Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo titu chhuan zawng zawng an boral vek hma loh chuan, thlalêrah kum sawmli a vah a vahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh u, Israel-te chunga Lalpa thinurna ṭihbaiawm tak belhchhahin, nangni chhuan sual hian in pute ai in awh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa zui lova in awm miau chuan anniho hi thlalêrah a awmtîr leh mai dâwn a ni a. Hêng mi zawng zawngte hi in tiboral mai ang asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, an va hnaih a, a hnênah, “Hetah hian kan ran tân berâm huangte leh kan fanaute tân khuate kan siam ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />keini erawh chu an hmun tûr kan thlen hma loh chuan, Israela thlahte hmaa kal zêl tûrin kan inrâlthuam diam ang e; hemi rama mite avâng hian kan fanaute chu kulh nei khuaahte an awm ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israela thlah mi tinin an hmun luah tûr an luah ṭheuh hma loh chuan kan in lamah kan haw lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kan luah tûr chu he lam râl Jordan chhak lam a nih avângin Jordan râl lehlam leh a piah lam chu kan luahpui dâwn lo nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Mosian an hnênah, “Chutianga in tiha, indonaa Lalpa hmaa kal tûra in inrâlthuama,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a hma ata a hmêlmate a hnawh chhuaha, Lalpa hmaa ram chu hneh a nih hma loh va in zînga inrâlthuam zawng zawngten Lalpa hmaah Jordan in kai vek chuan, nakinah in haw ang a, Lalpa chungah leh Israel-te chungah in thiam lo lo dâwn nia; tichuan, he ram hi Lalpa hmaa in luah tûr a lo ni ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chutianga in tih loh chuan, ngai teh u, Lalpa chungah in sual a ni ang a, in sual chuan a hmu chhuak ngei ngei ang che u tih hre rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In fanaute tân khuate siam ula, in berâmte tân pawh huangte siam ula, in sawi ang chuan ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Gada thlahte leh Reubena thlahte chuan Mosia hnênah, “I chhiahhlawhte hian kan pu thupêk ang chuan kan ti ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kan nupui fanau te, kan berâm rual te, kan ran rual zawng zawngte chu Gilead ram khuaahte hian an lo awm ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />amaherawhchu, i chhiahhlawh, indo tûra inrâlthuam zawng zawngte chuan kan pu sawi ang chuan Lalpa hmaah kan va kai ang e,” tiin an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mosia chuan an chungchâng thûah chuan puithiam Eleazara te, Nuna fapa Josua te, Israel hnam chhûngkaw puipate chu thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan an hnênah, “Gada thlahte, Reubena thlahte, indo tûra inrâlthuam zawng zawngte hian Lalpa hmaa Jordan lui an kaipui che ua, ram chu in hmin chuan Gilead ram chu an luah atân in pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, inrâlthuama an kaipui loh che u chuan Kanaan ramah in zîngah an tel ve mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Gada thlahte leh Reubena thlahte chuan, “I chhiahhlawhte hnêna Lalpan a sawi ang chuan kan ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Inrâlthuamin Lalpa hmaah Kanaan ramah kaiin kan lût ang a; tichuan, kan ram luah tûr chu Jordan lui piah lamah a la ni reng ang,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan, Gada thlahte leh Reubena thlahte leh Josefa fapa Manasea thlah hnam chanvete chu Amor lal Sihona ram te, Basan lal Oga ram, chûng ramte chu a khaw awm zawng zawng nên, a vêl ram khuate nên lam a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Gada thlahte chuan Dibon te, Atarot te, Aroer te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Atrot-sophan te, Jazer te, Jogbeha te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Beth-nimra te, Beth-haran te an din a, khawpui kulh nei te, berâm huang te nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Reubena thlahte chuan Hesbon te, Eleale te, Kiriathaim te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nebo te, Baal-meon te (a hmingte hi tihdanglam tâk a ni), Sibma te an din a; an khaw siamte chu hming dang an vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Manasea fapa Makira thlahte chu Gilead ramah an kal a, an la a, Amor-ho chuta awmte chu an chhuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Mosian Gilead ram chu Manasea fapa Makira chu a pe a, chutah chuan a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Manasea fapa Jaira chuan chûnga khuate chu a va la a, Havoth-jair a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Noba chuan Kenath a va la a, a khawperte nên, ama hming chawiin Noba a vuah a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona kaihhruaia Aigupta ram ata Israel-te a pâwl pâwla an chhuaha, an kal zêl dân chu hetiang hian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa thupêka an kal chhuaha, an kal zêlnate chu Mosian a ziak a; an kal chhuaha an kalnate chu hêngahte hian a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel-te chu Kalhlên Kût zawh aṭanga thla khatna ni sâwm leh ni nga nîah Rameses aṭangin an chhuak a; Kalhlên Kût tûk chuan Aigupta mite mit hmuhah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an fa tîr zawng zawng Lalpan a tihhlumsak an phûm laiin, Israela thlahte chu muk takin an chhuak a. Lalpan an pathiante pawh a hrem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte chu Rameses aṭangin an chhuak a, Sukkoth-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Sukkoth aṭangin an chhuak a, thlalêr tawntirha Etham-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Etham aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Baal-zephon bula Pi-hahirot lamah an tawlh kîr leh a, Migdol bulah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Hahirot bul ata chu an chhuak a, tuifinriat an kal tlang a, thlalêrah an lût a; tin, Etham thlalêrah ni thum an kal a, Mara-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Mara aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Elim an thleng a; Elim-ah chuan tuihna sâwm leh pahnih leh tûm kûng sawmsarih a awm a; chutah chuan awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Elim aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Tuifinriat Sen bulah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Tuifinriat Sen aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Sin thlalêrah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sin thlalêr aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Dopka-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Dopka aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Alus-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Alus aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Rephidim-ah awm hmun an khuar a, chutah chuan mipuite tui in tûr a awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Rephidim aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Sinai thlalêrah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sinai thlalêr aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Kibroth-hat-tava-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Kibroth-hat-tava aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Hazeroth-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hazeroth aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Rithma-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Rithma aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Rimon-perez-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rimon-perez aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Libna-ah awm hmun an khuar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Libna aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Risa-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Risa aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Kehelatha-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Kehelatha aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Sepher tlângah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Sepher tlâng aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Harada-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Harada aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Makheloth-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Makheloth aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Tahath-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Tahath aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Tera-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Tera aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Mithka-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Mitka aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Hasmona-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hasmona aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Moseroth-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Moseroth aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Bene-jaakan-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Bene-jaakan aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Hor-hagidgad-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Hor-hagidgad aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Jotbatha-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Jotbatha aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Abrona-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Abrona aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Ezion-geber-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Ezion-geber aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Zin thlalêrah awm hmun an khuar a (chu chu Kadesh an ti bawk).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Kadesh aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Edom ram dep Hor tlângah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Arona chu Lalpa thupêkin Hor tlângah chuan a han chho va, Israela thlahte Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuah kum sawmli kum, thla ngana, ni khat niin chutah chuan a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, Arona chu Hor tlânga a thih chuan kum za leh sawmhnih leh pathum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Kanaan mi, Kanaan rama Chhima awm Arad lal chuan Israela thlahte lo kal chu a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Hor tlâng aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Zalmon-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Zalmon aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Punon-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, Punon aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Oboth-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Oboth aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Moab ram dep Iye-abarim-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, Iyim aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Dibon-gad-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Dibon-gad aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Almon-diblathaim-ah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, Almon-diblathaim aṭang chuan an chhuak a, Nebo bula Abarim tlângahte chuan awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, Abarim tlâng aṭangte chuan an chhuak a, Jeriko zâwn, Jordan kam Moab phaiah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jordan kam Beth-jesimoth aṭanga Abel-sitim thlengin Moab phaiah awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, Jeriko zâwn, Jordan kam Moab phaiah chuan Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Israela thlahte chu bia la, an hnênah, ‘Jordan lui in kâna, Kanaan ram in luh hun chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />chumi rama awm zawng zawngte chu in hnawt chhuak vek ang a, an lung milem zawng zawngte chu in tichhe vek ang a, an milem chhûnte in tichhe vek ang a, an hmun sângte pawh in ṭhiat vek tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />tin, ram chu in luah ang a, chutah chuan in awm ang; in luah atân ram chu ka pe tawh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, a chi zir ang zêlin ṭhumvâwrin ram chu in luah ang a; a rual deuhte chu ram zau deuh in pe ang a, a rual lo deuhte chu ram zîm deuh in pe ang; ṭhumvâwra a tlûkna apiang chu an pual a ni ang a. In pi leh pute chi kal dân ang zêlin in luah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chumi rama awmte chu in hnawh chhuah loh chuan, in awmtîrte chu in mit tân chhuntu leh in pang tânte hlîng ang an ni ang a, in awmna ramah chuan an timangang ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, an chunga tih ka rilrûk ang chu in chungah ka ti ang,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte chu thu pe la, an hnênah, ‘Kanaan ram in thlen hun chuan (Kanaan ram, a ramri zir ang zêla in luah tûr ram chu)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chhim lama in luah tûr chin chu Zin thlalêr aṭanga Edom ram hrûl zêl a ni ang a, chhim lam ramri chu Tuifinriat Al tâwp aṭanga chhak lampang a ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tin, in ramri chu Akrabim chhohna chhim lampangah a kawi ang a, Zin-ah a kal tlang ang a; tin, a lo chhuahna chu Kadesh-barnea chhim lamah a ni ang; tin, Hazar-adar-ah a kal ang a, Azmon-ah a kal zêl ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, ramri chu Azmon aṭangin Aigupta lui thlengin a kawi ang a, a chhuahna chu tuifinriatah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, thlang lampangah chuan tuifinriat zau chu a ramri atân i chang ang a; hei hi thlang lama in ramri a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, hei hi hmâr lama in ramri a ni ang: tuifinriat zau aṭangin Hor tlâng huamin i siam ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hor tlâng aṭanga Hamath luhna thlengin i siam ang a, ramri chhuahna chu Zedad-ah a ni ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tin, ramri chu Ziphron-ah a kal zêl ang a; tin, a chhuahna chu Hazar-enan-ah a ni ang; hei hi hmâr lama in ramri a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, chhak lama in ramri chu Hazar-enan aṭangin Sepham thlengin i siam ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tin, ramri chu Sepham aṭangin Ribla thlengin Ain chhak lampangah a chhuk ang a; tichuan, ramri chu a chhuk zêl ang a, Kinereth tuifinriat chhak lampang a chhun ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tin, ramri chu Jordan-ah a chhuk ang a; tin, a chhuahna chu Tuifinriat Al-ah a ni ang. Hei hi a chheh vêla ramri kal dân ang hian in ram a ni ang,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chuan Israela thlahte chu thu a pe a, “Hei hi Lalpan hnam kua leh a chanvete pêk tûra thu a pêk, ṭhumvâwra in luah tûr ram chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Reubena thlahte hnamin an chhûngkaw zir zêl leh, Gada thlahte hnamin an chhûngkaw zir zêl leh, Manase hnam zâtve pawhin an ram luah tûr chu an chang ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnam hnih leh hnam zâtvete chuan an ram luah tûr chu, ni chhuahna lam Jeriko zâwn Jordan râl chhak lamah an chang tawh a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Luah tûra ram ṭhensawmpuitute hming chu hêngte hi a ni: puithiam Eleazara leh Nuna fapa Josua-te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ram luah tûr ṭhentu atân hnam tin zînga puipa pakhat ṭheuh in thlang tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûng mite hming chu hêng hi a ni: Juda hnama mi Jephunea fapa Kaleba;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Simeona thlahte hnama mi Amihuda fapa Semuela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin hnam mi Kislona fapa Elidada;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dana thlahte hnam zînga puipa Joglia fapa Bukia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Josefa thlahte zînga mi, Manasea thlahte puipa Ephoda fapa Haniela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ephraima thlahte hnam zînga puipa Siptana fapa Kemuela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zebuluna thlahte hnam zînga puipa Parnaka fapa Elizaphana;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Isakara thlahte hnam zînga puipa Azana fapa Paltiela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asera thlahte hnam zînga puipa Selomia fapa Ahihuda;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Naphtalia thlahte zînga puipa Amihuda fapa Pedahela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hêngho hi Kanaan rama Israela thlah ram luah tûr sem tûra Lalpan thu a pêkate chu an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Jeriko zâwn Jordan kam, Moab phaiah chuan Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israela thlahte chu thu pe la, an ramahte chuan Levi-ho awmna tûr khuate siamsak rawh se; tin, ran tlatna tûrin khaw dai kiang vêlte Levi-ho in pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuate chu an awmna tûr a ni ang a, a vêlte chu an bâwng leh an ran, an vulh zawng zawng tân a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, dai kiang Levi-ho in pêk tûr chu khaw kulh aṭanga tawng sângkhata thui a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, kulh pawn lam aṭangin in teh ang a, chhak lampangah tawng sânghnih, chhim lampangah tawng sânghnih, thlang lampangah tawng sânghnih, hmâr lampangah tawng sânghnih, khua a lai taka awmin. Hei hi an dai kiang pual a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Levi-ho in pêk tûr khuate chu tualthatte tlân nân tualtlânna khaw paruk a ni ang a; chûng lo chu khaw sawmli leh khaw hnih in pe bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levi-ho in pêk tûr khua zawng zawng chu khaw sawmli leh khaw riat a ni ang; dai kiang nên in pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israela thlahte luah khua in pêk dân tûr chu: a tam deuh aṭangin in pe tam ang a, a tlêm deuh aṭangin in pe tlêm ang a, mi tinin an luah ram tam dân azirin an khua chu Levi-ho an pe tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Israela thlahte bia la, an hnênah, ‘Jordan lui in kaia Kanaan ram in luh hun chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tualtlânna tûr khua in ruat tûr a ni, tual that palhtu tlân nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chûng khuate chu phuba latu laka in tualtlânna a ni ang; pung khâwm hmaa rorêlsak tûra a din hmaa tualthattu chu a thih loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, in tân tualtlânna tûr in ruatte chu khaw paruk a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jordan râlah khaw thum in ruat ang a, Kanaan ramah khaw thum in ruat ang a, tualtlânna khuate a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israela thlahte leh hnam dang leh an hnêna chêngte tân he khaw paruk hi tualtlânna a ni ang; chutah chuan tu pawh mi that palh apiang an tlân dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, thîr hmanga mi a beiha, a thih chuan tual that a ni a; tual that chu tihhlum ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, thi khawpa lunga mi a chhuta, a thih chuan tual that a ni a; tualthat chu tihhlum ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, thi khawpa mi thinga a vuaka, a thih chuan tual that a ni a; tualthat chu tihhlum ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thisen phuba latu chuan tualthattu chu a that nghâl mai ang; a hmuh hun hunah a tihlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, mi a huat vânga a nam vak emaw, lo châng rua a vawm emawa a thihin emaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />intaina avânga a chum hlum emaw chuan, a tihlumtu chu tihhlum ngei tûr a ni. Tualthat a ni. Thisen phuba latu chuan a hmuh hun hunah a tihlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, intai vâng ni lêm lova nam thut emaw, châng ni kher lova mi an awm tih pawh hre lova, a hmêlma pawh ni lova, a pawi khawih pawh tum ni chuang lova lung emawa a dena, mi lo thi ta a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />pung khâwmhovin hêng rorêlna dân ang hian a tihlumtu leh thisen phuba latu ro chu an rêlsak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, pung khâwmho chuan tualthattu chu thisen phuba latu lak ata chu an hum ang a, pung khâwmho chuan a tlânna, a tualtlânna khuaah chuan an awmtîr leh ang a, hriak thianghlima thih puithiam lal ṭang lai thih hma chu chutah chuan a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, eng lai pawhin tualthattu chu a tlânna, a tualtlânna khaw ramri pawn lama a kala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />thisen phuba latuin a tualtlânna khaw pâwna a hmuha, thisen phuba latuin a thah chuan, thisenah chuan thiam loh a chang lo vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />puithiam lal a thih hma loh chu a tualtlânna khuaa awm reng tûr a nih avângin. Puithiam a thih hnu erawh chuan tualthattu chu a awmna ramah chuan a haw leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hêng thil hi in thlahte thlenga in awmna apianga in rorêl dân tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tu pawhin mi a thah chuan tualthattu chu hretute kâ aṭanga thuchhuakin tihhlum tûr a ni; amaherawhchu, hretu pakhat chu mi tihhlumna tûr chuan a tâwk lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, tualthattu chu in tlan tûr a ni lo; thihna khawpa thiam loh chang a ni a, tihhlum ngei tûr a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, tualtlânna khuaa tlân chu, chutih laia puithiam lal thih hma chuan a awmna khaw hluia kîr leh tûra tlan phal a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, in awmna ram chu in tibawlhhlawh lo vang a; thisen chuan ram chu a tibawlhhlawh a, thisen chhuahna ram tihbawlhhlawh sil nân a chhuahtu thisen ngawt lo chu hman theih a ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />In awmna ram, ka awmna hi in tibawlhhlawh tûr a ni lo, kei Lalpa hi, Israela thlahte zîngah ka awm si a,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Josefa chhûngte zînga mi, Manasea fa Makira fapa Gileada thlahte chhûngkaw puipate zînga mite chuan an rawn hnaih a, Mosia leh hotu, Israela thlah puipate hmaah chuan thu an sawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan kan pu hi Israela thlahte chu, ṭhumvâwra an luah tûr ram pe tûrin thu a pe a; tin, Lalpan kan pu chu kan unaupa Zelophehada luah tûr chu a fanute pe tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan Israela thlahte zînga mi, hnam dang tu fate pawh nei sela, kan pi leh pute ram an luah chu lâksaka, an va telnate hnam ramah belh tûr a ni ang a; chutiang chuan kan ram chanpual ata chu theh chhuah a lo ni ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte Jubili a lo thlen hun chuan, an ram chu an va telna tûrte apiang hnam ramah belh a ni ang a; chutichuan, kan pi leh pute hnam ram ata chu an ram lâk hêk a lo ni dâwn a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Lalpa thu angin Israela thlahte chu thu a pe a, “Josefa fapate hnam hian an sawi dik a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zelophehada fanute chungchâng thûa Lalpan thu a pêk chu heti hian a ni, ‘ṭha an tih apiang nei sela; amaherawhchu, an pate hnampui zînga mi ngei an nei tûr a ni,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israela thlahte ram chu hnam dang dang hnênah sawn sawn a ni lo vang. Israela thlahte chuan an pi leh pute hnam ram chu an chang reng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte zînga roluahtu tûr fanu apiang chu, Israela thlahten an pi leh pute ram an luah ṭheuh zêl theih nân, a pa hnampui zînga mi ngei nupui a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, ram chu hnam dang dang hnênah sawn sawn a ni dâwn lo nia. Israela thlahte chuan anmahni ram ṭheuh chu an chang reng tûr a ni si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia thu a pêk ang chiahin Zelophehada fanute chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zelophehada fanu Malai te, Tirzai te, Hoglai te, Milkai te, Novai te chuan an pa unauva fapate an nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Josefa fa Manasea fapate an nei a, an ram chu an pa hnamah chuan a awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hêng hi Lalpan Mosia hmanga Jeriko zâwn Jordan râla Moab phaia Israela thlahte a pêk, thupêkte leh rorêl dânte chu a ni.
  </para>
</usx>
